WEBVTT

﻿1

00:01:46.969 --> 00:01:47.970
Will you marry me?


00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:49.528
Kabir... please.


00:01:50.039 --> 00:01:51.006
Okay.


00:01:51.807 --> 00:01:53.536
Will you marry me, please?


00:01:54.844 --> 00:01:56.004
Why are you doing this?


00:01:56.745 --> 00:01:58.645
Because sooner or later we will.


00:01:59.915 --> 00:02:01.280
We love each other.


00:02:01.984 --> 00:02:04.282
Our families seem to tolerate each other.


00:02:05.321 --> 00:02:08.290
l'm an architect and
you're an interior designer.


00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:10.149
We're perfect.


00:02:13.462 --> 00:02:14.520
What do you say?


00:02:16.065 --> 00:02:17.089
Are you sure?


00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:19.892
Natasha, please make it quick...


00:02:19.969 --> 00:02:20.697
my knee is hurting.


00:02:22.805 --> 00:02:23.772
Yes!


00:02:41.724 --> 00:02:46.354
lt seems like only yesterday
that Natasha came into this world.


00:02:46.795 --> 00:02:48.126
And today she's getting engaged.


00:02:49.698 --> 00:02:51.723
Kabir, l'm not losing a daughter.


00:02:52.801 --> 00:02:54.325
l'm gaining a son.


00:02:54.904 --> 00:02:56.132
You're so filmy, dad.


00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:01.567
Harryji


00:03:03.746 --> 00:03:07.045
Two years ago you commissioned me
to build your hotel.


00:03:08.017 --> 00:03:10.747
Who would've imagined that
one day we'll be a big family.


00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.280
On behalf of my family,
l welcome you all.


00:03:14.723 --> 00:03:15.587
Thank you so much.


00:03:16.225 --> 00:03:19.626
Did you ever know that you're my hero


00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:24.090
You're everything l wish l could be


00:03:25.367 --> 00:03:28.564
l can fly like an eagle


00:03:29.071 --> 00:03:34.099
Cause you're the wind beneath my wings


00:03:35.411 --> 00:03:41.281
You're the wind beneath my wings


00:03:46.021 --> 00:03:47.147
- That was lovely.


00:03:52.661 --> 00:03:53.529
Hello everyone.


00:03:53.529 --> 00:03:54.689
l am lmran.


00:03:55.464 --> 00:03:56.988
Kabir and l have been friends
since school.


00:03:57.199 --> 00:03:58.427
The three Musketeers!


00:03:58.701 --> 00:04:01.602
That's right, it was the name
uncle had given the three of us.


00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:02.837
The three Musketeers.


00:04:03.672 --> 00:04:05.908
Unfortunately, the third musketeer...


00:04:05.908 --> 00:04:08.103
Arjun is not with us anymore.


00:04:09.812 --> 00:04:12.804
Don't worry, he's alive.
He just isn't here right now.


00:04:14.984 --> 00:04:16.008
Anyway, Natasha...


00:04:16.285 --> 00:04:18.913
Kabir is one of the nicest guys ever.


00:04:20.055 --> 00:04:22.523
So, if you ever smash his BMW,
don't worry.


00:04:23.826 --> 00:04:24.850
Good excuse to get a new car.


00:04:26.295 --> 00:04:28.763
He's also very intelligent.


00:04:30.232 --> 00:04:32.257
So leave the kid's homework to him.


00:04:32.735 --> 00:04:34.069
You're a true friend, thanks.


00:04:34.069 --> 00:04:35.036
You're welcome, bro.


00:04:36.005 --> 00:04:37.870
He's very large hearted.


00:04:38.507 --> 00:04:40.376
So, don't think twice...


00:04:40.376 --> 00:04:42.003
just buy those diamonds.


00:04:48.484 --> 00:04:49.678
Basically Natasha...


00:04:50.286 --> 00:04:52.311
Kabir is a solid guy.


00:04:53.322 --> 00:04:55.722
Put your hand in his and
walk with him.


00:04:56.959 --> 00:04:58.449
Because no matter what...


00:04:58.694 --> 00:04:59.820
he will never let you down.


00:05:00.796 --> 00:05:02.286
- So sweet.
- Hear, hear!


00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:05.800
Thank you.


00:05:06.068 --> 00:05:06.966
You can send the cheque now.


00:05:09.071 --> 00:05:09.765
Tanya...


00:05:10.906 --> 00:05:11.770
thank you.


00:05:12.741 --> 00:05:14.140
Let me warn you...


00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:16.710
Nikhil is planning a
full power bachelor party.


00:05:17.146 --> 00:05:18.013
Too late.


00:05:18.013 --> 00:05:20.709
His school friends have planned
a bachelor holiday.


00:05:21.016 --> 00:05:22.005
A road trip...


00:05:22.217 --> 00:05:23.047
through Spain.


00:05:23.485 --> 00:05:25.350
-A road trip?
- Don't ask.


00:05:25.788 --> 00:05:28.290
They had made some pact
in college that...


00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:31.360
each one would choose
an adventure sport...


00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.385
Are you serious?
Like Fear Factor?.


00:05:33.896 --> 00:05:34.885
Exactly!


00:05:34.963 --> 00:05:37.454
And the other two would have to do it.


00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.394
So, what have you picked?


00:05:40.002 --> 00:05:41.367
That l can't say.


00:05:42.538 --> 00:05:43.937
Not in front of me, at least.


00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.138
You see...


00:05:46.208 --> 00:05:49.439
the sport we pick
is a surprise for the other two.


00:05:49.912 --> 00:05:50.901
Shut up!


00:05:51.146 --> 00:05:52.511
- Seriously.
- Are you kidding me?


00:05:52.881 --> 00:05:53.870
No.


00:05:54.183 --> 00:05:57.050
That ensures none of us back out.


00:05:58.053 --> 00:05:59.543
Whose idea was this?


00:06:00.055 --> 00:06:00.714
Mine.


00:06:01.457 --> 00:06:02.151
Three weeks.


00:06:02.358 --> 00:06:03.689
You know how these boys are.


00:06:04.226 --> 00:06:04.749
Not Kabir.


00:06:05.561 --> 00:06:06.721
Oh please!


00:06:07.062 --> 00:06:09.622
All guys go crazy at bachelor parties.


00:06:10.733 --> 00:06:11.927
ln fact...


00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:16.733
Nikhil still hasn't told me
what happened at his.


00:06:18.173 --> 00:06:19.037
l don't know.


00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:22.435
l heard something about
your bachelor party.


00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:28.914
Who told you?


00:06:29.184 --> 00:06:30.151
So it is true.


00:06:31.153 --> 00:06:32.051
Does Natasha know?


00:06:33.055 --> 00:06:34.249
No man, why would l tell her?


00:06:34.556 --> 00:06:36.046
Please... don't tell her.


00:06:37.793 --> 00:06:38.782
She was from Ukraine.


00:06:40.229 --> 00:06:41.560
- Bloody hot!
- Nice.


00:06:41.964 --> 00:06:42.828
l was sloshed.


00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.424
Okay, listen...


00:06:45.801 --> 00:06:48.292
lf Sameera finds out about this,
she'll kill me.


00:06:48.871 --> 00:06:50.270
l know, don't worry.


00:06:50.339 --> 00:06:53.509
lt was my last night as a bachelor.
You know l'd never do it otherwise.


00:06:53.509 --> 00:06:55.544
l understand, don't worry about it.


00:06:55.544 --> 00:06:56.533
- Please.
- lt happens.


00:06:58.147 --> 00:06:59.114
Sameera!


00:07:02.618 --> 00:07:03.676
Sorry, l couldn't resist.


00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:06.385
- Take care, man.
- See you.


00:07:09.358 --> 00:07:12.156
Trust me, this trick never fails.


00:07:12.628 --> 00:07:14.229
What do you mean?


00:07:14.229 --> 00:07:18.757
Well, you tell people you know
something about them...


00:07:18.834 --> 00:07:22.037
and before you know it,
they tell you their secrets.


00:07:22.037 --> 00:07:23.372
Shut up!


00:07:23.372 --> 00:07:25.567
You didn't know about the Ukrainian?


00:07:25.974 --> 00:07:27.339
No, he just told me.


00:07:28.677 --> 00:07:30.338
Mind blowing!


00:07:32.681 --> 00:07:35.514
- Yeah, well time equals money, Simon.
You want money, stop wasting my time.


00:07:36.218 --> 00:07:38.118
Sell 50,000 June contracts!


00:07:38.187 --> 00:07:40.417
50,000 and don't screw up
my stop losses this time!


00:07:41.623 --> 00:07:42.453
How much?


00:07:43.625 --> 00:07:44.990
Damn! That's horrendous!


00:07:45.661 --> 00:07:46.958
Sell it. Sell everything.


00:07:54.636 --> 00:07:56.839
Listen Joe, if you continue to give me
bullshit fills like that...


00:07:56.839 --> 00:07:58.966
l'm going to have to trade
my Ferrari in for a Ford Fiesta!


00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:04.171
We have white and gold and...


00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:05.908
tonnes of champagne.


00:08:06.415 --> 00:08:07.245
And...


00:08:08.317 --> 00:08:09.545
- the centre peice.
- This is nice.


00:08:10.519 --> 00:08:11.417
Finally!


00:08:11.987 --> 00:08:12.681
Kabira!


00:08:13.155 --> 00:08:14.713
Sorry man.


00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.519
You have no idea what's happening here.


00:08:16.692 --> 00:08:18.853
And you have no idea
what a nice party you missed.


00:08:19.795 --> 00:08:21.023
l'm sure, man.


00:08:21.497 --> 00:08:22.521
Listen...


00:08:22.998 --> 00:08:24.226
l've a problem.


00:08:24.967 --> 00:08:26.502
l can't make it to Spain.


00:08:26.502 --> 00:08:27.025
- What?!


00:08:28.303 --> 00:08:29.805
Arjun, you promised!


00:08:29.805 --> 00:08:31.573
l know but...


00:08:31.573 --> 00:08:34.599
l thought this deal l'm working on
would come through...


00:08:34.743 --> 00:08:35.402
- but l'm stuck.


00:08:36.011 --> 00:08:38.809
l can't believe you're ditching me
on my bachelor trip.


00:08:39.815 --> 00:08:41.116
lt's not that...


00:08:41.116 --> 00:08:42.481
- Then what is it?


00:08:42.718 --> 00:08:45.209
We had decided to do this together.


00:08:46.989 --> 00:08:49.355
lf you can't make it,
l'm calling it off.


00:08:49.691 --> 00:08:51.921
Don't get sentimental.
lt's my work!


00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.695
l'm not.


00:08:53.695 --> 00:08:56.565
lt's been cancelled once before,
so let's do it again.


00:08:56.565 --> 00:08:57.862
lt's fine.


00:08:59.234 --> 00:09:02.692
lt's either the three of us going
or none at all.


00:09:26.795 --> 00:09:27.853
Hey...


00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:29.558
Hi.


00:09:29.798 --> 00:09:30.457
How are you?


00:09:30.966 --> 00:09:31.830
Good.


00:09:33.235 --> 00:09:35.203
Looking good,
you've been working out?


00:09:35.737 --> 00:09:36.294
Yes.


00:09:36.838 --> 00:09:38.328
l usually come in the morning.


00:09:43.645 --> 00:09:45.476
l was going to call you.


00:09:46.381 --> 00:09:47.370
Then why didn't you?


00:09:48.951 --> 00:09:50.316
l'm getting married.


00:09:54.523 --> 00:09:57.048
-That was quick.
- Arjun, please!


00:10:01.964 --> 00:10:03.295
All the best, Rohini.


00:10:20.882 --> 00:10:22.816
- Arjun, it's me again.


00:10:23.318 --> 00:10:25.220
- Don't ditch me.


00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.711
- l know why you're making excuses.


00:10:28.357 --> 00:10:30.359
- But it's been four years
for that incident.


00:10:30.359 --> 00:10:31.348
- l'm getting married now.


00:10:32.361 --> 00:10:34.556
- Even today, l only have two friends.


00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.829
- We're the three Musketeers.
All for one, one for all.


00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.598
Have you thought about...


00:10:47.843 --> 00:10:48.867
what we spoke?


00:10:49.678 --> 00:10:50.303
About what?


00:10:51.913 --> 00:10:55.041
Are you moving back to Bombay?


00:10:55.651 --> 00:10:56.640
Ammi...


00:10:57.486 --> 00:11:00.455
l like Delhi and living on my own.


00:11:07.162 --> 00:11:10.065
And this trip to Spain...


00:11:10.065 --> 00:11:12.727
is it a coincidence or
did you plan it?


00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.370
Why don't you just say
what you're really thinking?


00:11:18.874 --> 00:11:19.841
Fine.


00:11:21.009 --> 00:11:22.636
Do you intend to meet Salman?


00:11:23.912 --> 00:11:25.414
l don't know.


00:11:25.414 --> 00:11:27.439
lmran, why don't you trust me?


00:11:28.116 --> 00:11:29.851
lt's not about you Ammi.


00:11:29.851 --> 00:11:32.220
- He is my father.
- He's your father?


00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:37.385
Has he ever called you
or tried to find out how you are?


00:11:37.459 --> 00:11:39.450
Maybe he did and
you kept it from me.


00:11:40.962 --> 00:11:43.328
Until recently l wasn't even aware
that he is my father.


00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:45.724
Alright.


00:11:45.967 --> 00:11:47.469
Do what you want.


00:11:47.469 --> 00:11:50.005
But please remember this.


00:11:50.005 --> 00:11:52.030
Faisal was your only father.


00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.207
- Hello there.
- Hello.


00:12:00.649 --> 00:12:01.983
l can see you.


00:12:01.983 --> 00:12:04.152
l miss you, baby.


00:12:04.152 --> 00:12:06.643
Now we can see each other everyday.


00:12:06.888 --> 00:12:09.356
l'm only going for
three weeks, Natasha.


00:12:18.133 --> 00:12:20.431
What will l do in London all alone?


00:12:20.869 --> 00:12:23.071
You'll shop.


00:12:23.071 --> 00:12:27.269
And in three weeks l'll come to London
to carry your shopping bags.


00:12:27.342 --> 00:12:29.333
- Very funny.
- l know.


00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.369
- l don't see Madrid in this plan.
- Because it's not there.


00:16:14.369 --> 00:16:16.234
- We travel to Spain but
we're not going to see the capital?


00:16:16.304 --> 00:16:18.373
- We don't have enough time.


00:16:18.373 --> 00:16:20.068
- We can't change it now.
- l think we should.


00:16:20.141 --> 00:16:21.472
Look who's here!


00:16:22.811 --> 00:16:24.972
- Welcome! How was your flight?
- Hello.


00:16:26.014 --> 00:16:27.248
Well...


00:16:27.248 --> 00:16:28.442
it flew.


00:16:28.850 --> 00:16:30.044
Funny!


00:16:38.626 --> 00:16:41.196
- Good to see you.
- You too.


00:16:41.196 --> 00:16:42.254
l'm sorry about Abu.


00:16:43.131 --> 00:16:44.758
l got your email.


00:16:45.867 --> 00:16:47.562
- How's Ammi?
- She's fine.


00:16:48.136 --> 00:16:50.366
lt's not easy to get over these things.


00:16:51.806 --> 00:16:52.795
How've you been?


00:16:53.174 --> 00:16:54.072
l'm good.


00:16:54.142 --> 00:16:55.477
Pretty good actually.


00:16:55.477 --> 00:16:57.604
l've a new apartment.
Three bedrooms, big space.


00:16:58.346 --> 00:16:59.347
Nice.


00:16:59.347 --> 00:17:01.649
l can't believe we're together again.


00:17:01.649 --> 00:17:03.344
- Yeah.
- Finally!


00:17:03.718 --> 00:17:04.616
Should we sit?


00:17:05.653 --> 00:17:07.484
So, here is the plan.


00:17:07.989 --> 00:17:09.190
First...


00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:11.750
we go to Costa Brava,
which is my choice.


00:17:12.627 --> 00:17:14.356
Then Arjun wants to go to Seville.


00:17:14.996 --> 00:17:16.398
And then we'll head to...


00:17:16.398 --> 00:17:17.922
Pampalona which you've chosen.


00:17:17.999 --> 00:17:20.194
Tomorrow morning we leave for
Costa Brava.


00:17:26.741 --> 00:17:27.969
What are you doing with the laptop?


00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:29.878
l'm looking for an address.


00:17:29.878 --> 00:17:31.175
Hola Kabira.


00:17:34.549 --> 00:17:36.039
Kabira...


00:17:36.451 --> 00:17:37.509
Your treasure.


00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.415
Brilliant. Thanks a ton.


00:17:44.626 --> 00:17:46.287
What have you done to this?


00:17:46.694 --> 00:17:47.752
Dude!


00:17:47.829 --> 00:17:51.499
First of all, be thankful that
l bought this 12,000 Euro bag for you!


00:17:51.499 --> 00:17:52.397
What?


00:17:53.868 --> 00:17:54.527
Here... show, show...


00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.971
12,000 Euro for this purse?


00:18:01.476 --> 00:18:02.807
Way more than your salary.


00:18:06.214 --> 00:18:06.771
What?


00:18:07.949 --> 00:18:09.439
Natasha loves these bags.


00:18:09.884 --> 00:18:11.112
And l love cars, Kabir.


00:18:11.886 --> 00:18:13.080
Always remember.


00:18:13.154 --> 00:18:15.213
lf you ever want to gift
me an expensive car...


00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.958
don't hesitate.


00:18:16.958 --> 00:18:18.393
l won't.


00:18:18.393 --> 00:18:18.916
Good.


00:18:18.993 --> 00:18:19.994
Let's go.


00:18:19.994 --> 00:18:21.325
l can't.


00:18:22.063 --> 00:18:23.898
l need to make some calls.


00:18:23.898 --> 00:18:24.694
l'll see you guys later.


00:18:26.134 --> 00:18:27.499
Adios amigos.


00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.865
- l thought this was a holiday.
- Me too.


00:18:31.573 --> 00:18:33.234
Let's go.


00:18:33.508 --> 00:18:34.475
We take the next right.


00:18:38.646 --> 00:18:40.113
- Looks quite old.
- There it is.


00:18:44.052 --> 00:18:45.212
There is the cathedral.


00:18:46.554 --> 00:18:48.613
- Do you know where this place is?
- Yes, straight ahead.


00:18:49.023 --> 00:18:50.513
How far is this gallery?


00:18:51.359 --> 00:18:52.326
Shut up!


00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:53.957
lt's just here.


00:18:54.629 --> 00:18:57.029
This is the street.
Catonia... whatever.


00:18:59.067 --> 00:19:00.261
And that's the place.


00:19:00.335 --> 00:19:01.495
l guess.


00:19:13.314 --> 00:19:14.508
Hey!


00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.078
Salman Habib.


00:19:20.155 --> 00:19:21.349
lt's a desi name.


00:19:22.323 --> 00:19:24.052
He must be Pakistani or lndian.


00:19:39.807 --> 00:19:40.603
Thanks.


00:19:45.146 --> 00:19:46.648
l wish you'd come with us.


00:19:46.648 --> 00:19:48.809
We walked all over
looking for his gallery.


00:19:49.384 --> 00:19:51.113
Man, this city is beautiful.


00:19:51.186 --> 00:19:54.212
Well, today l made
a 2,000 Pound commission, so...


00:19:54.289 --> 00:19:55.654
excuse me if l don't complain.


00:19:56.391 --> 00:19:57.119
Cheers.


00:19:57.192 --> 00:19:58.659
- 2,000 Pounds?
- Yup!


00:19:59.027 --> 00:19:59.493
Cheers.


00:20:04.132 --> 00:20:05.099
Dude...


00:20:05.667 --> 00:20:06.998
l heard something about you.


00:20:08.203 --> 00:20:08.897
What?


00:20:11.206 --> 00:20:12.264
You know what it is.


00:20:14.209 --> 00:20:15.039
Mom told you?


00:20:17.912 --> 00:20:19.038
Yes.


00:20:20.882 --> 00:20:23.350
But did she tell you l was forced?


00:20:23.618 --> 00:20:25.176
- Okay?
- Okay.


00:20:26.621 --> 00:20:28.612
God man!
She can't keep anything to herself.


00:20:29.524 --> 00:20:30.718
She's driving me crazy, man.


00:20:31.459 --> 00:20:32.160
Yeah.


00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.828
She came to London a few days ago.


00:20:33.828 --> 00:20:35.997
And dragged me to
some friend's relative's place.


00:20:35.997 --> 00:20:36.827
To see a girl.


00:20:37.699 --> 00:20:40.429
Neelu aunty and
Gogi uncle's daughter Cookie.


00:20:40.802 --> 00:20:43.635
l'd decided that l'd go,
have some tea...


00:20:43.838 --> 00:20:46.705
exchange pleasantries and
decline the match.


00:20:48.042 --> 00:20:50.044
As l took the first sip...


00:20:50.044 --> 00:20:51.272
Cookie said 'no'!


00:20:51.813 --> 00:20:52.837
So... you know...


00:20:53.481 --> 00:20:54.182
What?!


00:20:54.182 --> 00:20:55.843
l mean, so what!
What is there?


00:21:01.289 --> 00:21:01.983
What?


00:21:04.792 --> 00:21:06.259
Come on, man!


00:21:07.528 --> 00:21:09.758
You were set up for
an arranged marriage...


00:21:09.831 --> 00:21:11.065
and you got rejected?


00:21:11.065 --> 00:21:13.397
But l didn't even try
to create an impression.


00:21:13.468 --> 00:21:15.336
- Now you're just saying it.
- l didn't want to impress her!


00:21:15.336 --> 00:21:16.667
You've ruined our reputation.


00:21:17.205 --> 00:21:19.571
Shut up, please stop it!


00:21:20.675 --> 00:21:23.303
Why did she have to tell you?
What's wrong with her?


00:21:24.178 --> 00:21:26.514
Actually, your mom said nothing.


00:21:26.514 --> 00:21:29.984
lt's his latest trick.
And you're his latest victim.


00:21:29.984 --> 00:21:31.008
- Cheers!


00:21:31.886 --> 00:21:32.944
2,000 Pounds!


00:21:36.724 --> 00:21:38.954
Grow up, man!


00:21:40.295 --> 00:21:41.694
How old are you?


00:21:43.698 --> 00:21:44.255
You know what...


00:21:44.666 --> 00:21:46.234
we have to have some shots.


00:21:46.234 --> 00:21:48.566
- One for Cookie.
- We'll raise a toast to Cookie.


00:21:48.636 --> 00:21:49.694
Okay.


00:21:51.506 --> 00:21:53.174
Not for me.


00:21:53.174 --> 00:21:54.664
l have a conference call
in an hour.


00:21:55.076 --> 00:21:56.634
Same old plan?


00:21:56.711 --> 00:21:58.338
Mint money and retire at 40?


00:21:58.713 --> 00:21:59.737
Yup!


00:21:59.814 --> 00:22:00.712
That's the plan.


00:22:11.392 --> 00:22:13.227
Listen...


00:22:13.227 --> 00:22:14.251
thank you.


00:22:14.962 --> 00:22:15.929
For what?


00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:18.755
For coming on this trip.
lt means a lot to me.


00:22:21.235 --> 00:22:22.862
l'm sure it does.


00:22:30.478 --> 00:22:32.013
Literacy is the key.


00:22:32.013 --> 00:22:33.640
lt's not that simple.


00:22:34.482 --> 00:22:37.451
Oh - my - God!


00:22:42.857 --> 00:22:45.985
Kabira, amazing choice.


00:22:46.361 --> 00:22:48.921
She's gorgeous but she isn't ours.


00:22:49.997 --> 00:22:50.986
What?


00:22:51.632 --> 00:22:53.190
An SUV will be a lot comfortable.


00:22:53.968 --> 00:22:56.698
To hell with the comfort.
Just look at her!


00:23:00.541 --> 00:23:01.735
Guys?


00:23:02.977 --> 00:23:05.747
- Hola, good morning.
Your name?


00:23:05.747 --> 00:23:06.714
- Kabir Dewan.
- Guys!


00:23:07.582 --> 00:23:09.277
Kabir... Arjun...


00:23:09.984 --> 00:23:11.178
She's beautiful.


00:23:14.322 --> 00:23:17.314
l've booked an SUV and
they've charged me, sorry.


00:23:18.059 --> 00:23:19.424
Sell Natasha's purse.


00:23:20.695 --> 00:23:21.662
Funny.


00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:23.524
Please!


00:23:24.031 --> 00:23:26.499
What are you doing?
Behave yourself!


00:23:28.636 --> 00:23:30.627
Oh, don't even
think about it, dude.


00:23:31.339 --> 00:23:33.807
All my life l sat in your car.


00:23:35.243 --> 00:23:36.642
Now it's my turn.


00:23:39.313 --> 00:23:41.215
What are you doing?


00:23:41.215 --> 00:23:43.615
12,000 Euro. She rides first class.


00:24:47.415 --> 00:24:50.213
Hey Sarah, what's up?
Mr. Yamamoto called?


00:24:52.053 --> 00:24:53.918
Well, he'll have
the docket in two days.


00:24:55.323 --> 00:24:58.554
No, no don't say l'm on a holiday.
Just get Joe to call me back. Bye.


00:25:04.499 --> 00:25:05.989
Hey Joe, what's up?


00:25:06.801 --> 00:25:08.359
Like... 'now' now?


00:25:10.204 --> 00:25:14.106
Yeah, okay.
Yeah, l'll do it, bye.


00:25:22.216 --> 00:25:23.410
Sorry guys.


00:25:37.798 --> 00:25:40.631
Guys... ten minutes tops!


00:25:43.137 --> 00:25:44.365
Moshi moshi, Arjun-san.


00:25:44.906 --> 00:25:46.703
Moshi moshi, Yamamoto-san.


00:25:48.809 --> 00:25:50.678
How are you?


00:25:50.678 --> 00:25:52.373
l'm fine, thank you.


00:25:53.514 --> 00:25:54.845
Moshi, moshi?.


00:25:55.983 --> 00:25:57.382
lt's Japanese for hello.


00:25:57.652 --> 00:26:00.018
- l assure you,
l will always be here for you.


00:26:03.524 --> 00:26:04.889
Kabira...


00:26:04.959 --> 00:26:06.654
look at this amazing view.


00:26:07.562 --> 00:26:09.257
And, now look at our friend.


00:26:09.864 --> 00:26:11.866
My team is going to
put together all the information.


00:26:11.866 --> 00:26:13.424
And you will have
the docket with you in three days.


00:26:15.202 --> 00:26:16.191
What happened to him, dude?


00:26:18.205 --> 00:26:19.729
lf you ask me...


00:26:19.807 --> 00:26:21.638
he has become mantally sick.


00:26:22.543 --> 00:26:25.103
And he needs the psychaitrixt.


00:26:26.647 --> 00:26:27.841
lsn't this from school?


00:26:28.215 --> 00:26:29.443
Not school.


00:26:29.517 --> 00:26:32.008
- Eschool!
- Eschool.


00:26:32.286 --> 00:26:33.020
Eschoo!.


00:26:33.020 --> 00:26:36.421
Because only the Mr. the Dubey
can the talk like this.


00:26:36.857 --> 00:26:39.052
The Mr. the Dubey.


00:26:39.126 --> 00:26:43.426
Are you mantally challanged my buy?


00:26:44.865 --> 00:26:45.832
Not buy.


00:26:47.468 --> 00:26:48.302
bwoy.


00:26:48.302 --> 00:26:50.471
- bwoy.


00:26:50.471 --> 00:26:52.373
Mantally challangedmy bwoy...


00:26:52.373 --> 00:26:53.362
Mantal bwoy.


00:26:55.476 --> 00:26:56.374
Thank you, Mr. Yamamoto.


00:26:59.146 --> 00:27:00.875
Let's go. l'm done.


00:27:01.148 --> 00:27:02.206
Arjun, my bwoy...


00:27:02.717 --> 00:27:05.550
you look the mantalin this the uniform!


00:27:07.455 --> 00:27:08.319
Let's go.


00:27:09.490 --> 00:27:11.617
Okay, the very the well the saids.


00:27:36.117 --> 00:27:37.685
Guys...


00:27:37.685 --> 00:27:39.516
just do as l say.


00:27:40.521 --> 00:27:43.357
lt's been ten years since college.
Please grow up.


00:27:43.357 --> 00:27:45.917
- Don't do this, please.
- Trust me.


00:27:45.993 --> 00:27:47.893
You'll kiss me later.


00:27:48.629 --> 00:27:50.197
When l shout...


00:27:50.197 --> 00:27:53.394
point to the urinal and
scream loudly.


00:28:12.319 --> 00:28:13.547
Bye!


00:28:20.294 --> 00:28:22.353
Dude, you're the mantallythe sick!


00:28:23.731 --> 00:28:26.291
People are the same everywhere.


00:28:26.367 --> 00:28:27.857
lt's just human nature.


00:28:33.741 --> 00:28:34.435
What are you doing?


00:28:36.877 --> 00:28:38.538
Poor thing's feeling hot.


00:28:40.147 --> 00:28:40.943
Poor thing?


00:28:41.215 --> 00:28:42.443
Kabira...


00:28:43.484 --> 00:28:45.782
meet Bagwati.


00:28:48.155 --> 00:28:50.646
What's happened to your jokes?


00:28:50.858 --> 00:28:52.155
Are they sick?


00:28:52.993 --> 00:28:55.791
Well, they've taken after you.


00:28:56.063 --> 00:28:58.554
Hey Joe, yes l spoke to
Mr. Yamamoto and...


00:28:59.333 --> 00:29:01.358
Somebody please
throw his phone out.


00:29:04.038 --> 00:29:05.062
What the...


00:29:07.241 --> 00:29:08.208
-Are you mad?


00:29:10.377 --> 00:29:11.366
Did you just...


00:29:23.190 --> 00:29:23.918
You think we'll get it?


00:29:28.162 --> 00:29:30.865
Sorry, l didn't think he would do it.


00:29:30.865 --> 00:29:32.560
Of course you didn't know, Kabir.


00:29:33.701 --> 00:29:34.827
Now go find my phone.


00:29:35.236 --> 00:29:36.260
- Where?
- l don't know.


00:29:36.337 --> 00:29:37.634
l want my phone, that's all.


00:29:37.905 --> 00:29:38.739
lt could've broken.


00:29:38.739 --> 00:29:40.934
Arjun, don't be silly...
we won't find it.


00:29:41.008 --> 00:29:41.838
Silly?


00:29:42.409 --> 00:29:44.639
You threw my phone out
of a moving car, you moron!


00:29:45.412 --> 00:29:47.607
He said it, l threw it.


00:29:47.681 --> 00:29:48.170
Didn't you?


00:29:48.382 --> 00:29:49.747
Kabir...


00:29:49.817 --> 00:29:51.375
please tell me to slap him.


00:29:51.452 --> 00:29:52.353
Don't be silly.


00:29:52.353 --> 00:29:53.251
Just tell me to slap him.


00:29:53.654 --> 00:29:55.019
Just tell me to slap him.


00:29:55.656 --> 00:29:56.452
Slap him.


00:29:59.493 --> 00:30:00.289
- What's wrong with you?
- Guys!


00:30:01.228 --> 00:30:03.093
l'll get you a new phone.
l was just joking.


00:30:03.230 --> 00:30:04.899
Well, it's not funny.


00:30:04.899 --> 00:30:06.526
That call was important.


00:30:07.301 --> 00:30:10.532
You think being 'cool and funny'
gives you the license to do anything?


00:30:10.971 --> 00:30:13.140
lt's always like,
'lmran said this. He's so funny.'


00:30:13.140 --> 00:30:14.909
lmran did that, he is so cool'.


00:30:14.909 --> 00:30:16.243
Grow up!


00:30:16.243 --> 00:30:18.234
Throwing my phone
out the window is not funny!


00:30:18.312 --> 00:30:21.611
Hooking up with my girlfriend
was not funny!


00:30:27.488 --> 00:30:28.455
Listen...


00:30:28.989 --> 00:30:30.547
it's been four years.


00:30:30.624 --> 00:30:32.193
And l've apologised for it.


00:30:32.193 --> 00:30:33.751
Now let it go.


00:30:34.395 --> 00:30:35.794
Or what? Huh, what?


00:30:36.463 --> 00:30:38.294
Stop it. Stop it, you two.


00:30:40.000 --> 00:30:41.194
You're behaving like kids.


00:30:43.537 --> 00:30:45.095
lf there's a problem,
deal with it.


00:30:45.172 --> 00:30:45.797
Like adults.


00:30:46.173 --> 00:30:47.333
Who made you the judge?


00:30:47.675 --> 00:30:48.742
Do you see anyone else here?


00:30:48.742 --> 00:30:49.470
Listen.


00:30:49.810 --> 00:30:51.378
Let's get this straight.


00:30:51.378 --> 00:30:52.538
l don't have any problem with him.


00:30:54.315 --> 00:30:56.350
Why would you have a problem?


00:30:56.350 --> 00:30:57.749
Sonali was my girlfriend.


00:30:58.052 --> 00:30:59.610
Come on, Sonali and me
fell in love.


00:31:00.988 --> 00:31:02.387
lt happens. Shit happens.


00:31:03.324 --> 00:31:03.722
Yeah.


00:31:04.959 --> 00:31:05.755
lt was shit.


00:31:06.827 --> 00:31:07.623
For me.


00:31:08.729 --> 00:31:11.095
And l'm sure you didn't
give it a second thought.


00:31:13.300 --> 00:31:14.460
lmran man...


00:31:15.569 --> 00:31:17.628
l would never do that to you.


00:31:17.972 --> 00:31:18.768
Arjun...


00:31:19.340 --> 00:31:21.535
l screwed up.
Now what do you want me to do?


00:31:22.142 --> 00:31:22.801
What do l do?


00:31:23.010 --> 00:31:24.341
Should l wear a 'Sorry, Arjun' t-shirt
and walk around?


00:31:24.712 --> 00:31:25.337
What should l do?


00:31:26.914 --> 00:31:27.573
Just look at him.


00:31:28.983 --> 00:31:30.348
Listen to me, okay.
You two, please!


00:31:31.018 --> 00:31:32.007
Sonali was a bitch.


00:31:32.987 --> 00:31:33.510
Understand?


00:31:33.687 --> 00:31:35.018
l'm sorry, really.


00:31:35.222 --> 00:31:36.780
She used you.


00:31:36.857 --> 00:31:38.256
Then gave you a BPL
and used him.


00:31:38.692 --> 00:31:40.023
And she dumped you as well.


00:31:40.628 --> 00:31:43.096
She was a waste of time then
and she is a waste of time now.


00:31:43.898 --> 00:31:47.231
Four years ago we cancelled
this trip because of her.


00:31:47.301 --> 00:31:50.293
Today we're here for me.
Don't let her ruin this.


00:31:50.537 --> 00:31:51.401
Please!


00:31:53.207 --> 00:31:54.697
How many times
do l have to apologise?


00:31:56.310 --> 00:31:58.175
How many times?
Let's just make it clear.


00:31:59.880 --> 00:32:02.348
Till it doesn't come from here.


00:32:09.323 --> 00:32:10.347
What's BPL?


00:32:11.292 --> 00:32:12.156
Bum Pe Laat.
[Kick in the arse.]


00:32:19.466 --> 00:32:20.501
You're crazy.


00:32:20.501 --> 00:32:23.026
Speak with him.
He slapped me.


00:32:25.339 --> 00:32:26.397
l can't believe this.


00:32:40.054 --> 00:32:41.419
Hi baby...


00:32:42.523 --> 00:32:43.251
Good.


00:32:44.358 --> 00:32:45.916
We've left Barcelona.


00:32:47.194 --> 00:32:48.491
On the road.


00:32:49.396 --> 00:32:50.920
Yes, it's beautiful.


00:32:52.232 --> 00:32:55.201
Of course, they're with me.
Where will they go?


00:32:57.371 --> 00:32:58.736
Everything is cool.


00:33:00.908 --> 00:33:01.875
Yeah.


00:33:18.959 --> 00:33:20.861
All ready.


00:33:20.861 --> 00:33:22.158
Come on.


00:33:24.565 --> 00:33:25.623
Yes!


00:33:25.699 --> 00:33:27.234
Now this is a house.


00:33:27.234 --> 00:33:28.929
- l like.
- Cool.


00:33:29.003 --> 00:33:30.204
lt's lovely.


00:33:30.204 --> 00:33:32.104
You haven't seen the half of it yet.


00:33:33.741 --> 00:33:34.765
Can we slide?


00:33:35.242 --> 00:33:36.140
No, you can't.


00:33:36.744 --> 00:33:37.911
- Captain.
-Amazing.


00:33:37.911 --> 00:33:39.242
Wow, man!


00:33:39.913 --> 00:33:41.574
This is nicer than the pictures.


00:33:47.187 --> 00:33:48.055
Amazing.


00:33:48.055 --> 00:33:49.044
What a view!


00:33:53.193 --> 00:33:54.353
Someday.


00:34:39.807 --> 00:34:40.974
How was it?


00:34:40.974 --> 00:34:41.998
Refreshing.


00:34:44.411 --> 00:34:46.140
Who is she?


00:34:46.213 --> 00:34:47.339
How should l know, dude?


00:34:49.716 --> 00:34:50.774
She's nice.


00:34:52.286 --> 00:34:53.617
Really nice.


00:34:56.490 --> 00:34:57.650
What's happening?


00:34:58.559 --> 00:35:00.220
She's got me.
She's pulling me towards her.


00:35:01.728 --> 00:35:02.626
She's pulling me.


00:35:02.696 --> 00:35:04.027
l saw her first.


00:35:05.532 --> 00:35:06.590
So true.


00:35:07.835 --> 00:35:10.497
But has she seen you?


00:35:13.407 --> 00:35:14.101
What?


00:35:15.843 --> 00:35:18.368
- Hola.
- Hola.


00:35:19.746 --> 00:35:20.405
Can l try that?


00:35:22.282 --> 00:35:22.680
Yeah.


00:35:23.383 --> 00:35:24.077
Thanks.


00:35:28.822 --> 00:35:30.324
Where are you from?


00:35:30.324 --> 00:35:31.052
Brazil?


00:35:32.292 --> 00:35:33.520
Half US, half lndia.


00:35:34.228 --> 00:35:34.922
lndia?


00:35:36.363 --> 00:35:37.830
What a coincidence!
Which part?


00:35:38.565 --> 00:35:40.795
My dad's from Delhi but
l live in London.


00:35:41.969 --> 00:35:43.527
Hindi? Not bad!


00:35:43.971 --> 00:35:45.962
You too... wow!


00:35:49.209 --> 00:35:52.178
lf you're free,
want to join me for a drink?


00:35:57.518 --> 00:35:58.507
l have an early morning.


00:35:59.686 --> 00:36:00.550
Sorry.


00:36:06.460 --> 00:36:07.427
Thanks.


00:36:17.037 --> 00:36:17.560
Bye.


00:36:22.075 --> 00:36:23.599
What's your name?


00:36:23.677 --> 00:36:24.473
Laila.


00:36:24.978 --> 00:36:25.672
lmran.


00:36:26.413 --> 00:36:29.109
But my friends call me 'Romeo'.


00:36:41.228 --> 00:36:42.396
Romeo?


00:36:42.396 --> 00:36:44.694
Seriously man... Romeo?


00:36:45.999 --> 00:36:47.398
l mean, chee!


00:36:47.901 --> 00:36:48.595
Arjun...


00:36:49.736 --> 00:36:51.704
lt's a man's duty to try.


00:36:52.539 --> 00:36:55.235
Success and failure are in His hands.


00:36:55.576 --> 00:36:57.237
Great, professor.


00:36:59.046 --> 00:37:00.206
Seriously?


00:37:00.514 --> 00:37:02.311
You got me this time!


00:37:13.293 --> 00:37:14.021
What the hell is this?


00:37:15.128 --> 00:37:15.924
What?


00:37:19.566 --> 00:37:20.897
This! What the hell is this?


00:37:21.301 --> 00:37:23.503
You said l had to
get you a new phone.


00:37:23.503 --> 00:37:24.697
You didn't specify which one.


00:37:25.305 --> 00:37:26.673
l'm a trader.


00:37:26.673 --> 00:37:27.867
Not a Japanese school girl.


00:37:28.809 --> 00:37:29.639
Moshi moshi.


00:37:30.978 --> 00:37:32.809
Shut up, just shut up!


00:37:33.213 --> 00:37:35.681
- Just don't talk to me.
- Guys that's enough!


00:37:36.617 --> 00:37:38.642
Look at this.
What's wrong with him?


00:37:39.720 --> 00:37:40.618
What's wrong with you?


00:37:40.988 --> 00:37:42.353
lt's funny.


00:37:43.457 --> 00:37:44.625
Anyway, now listen.


00:37:44.625 --> 00:37:46.252
Why we are here in Costa Brava.


00:37:47.561 --> 00:37:48.391
Ready for this?


00:37:49.329 --> 00:37:49.727
Yeah.


00:37:52.499 --> 00:37:53.693
Deep... sea...


00:37:54.368 --> 00:37:54.925
diving.


00:37:57.004 --> 00:37:57.663
What?


00:37:58.505 --> 00:38:00.666
Yes, our training begins
first thing tomorrow.


00:38:01.341 --> 00:38:03.010
l'm sorry but...


00:38:03.010 --> 00:38:05.178
why is this turning into a
let's torture Arjun holiday?


00:38:05.178 --> 00:38:06.546
l just don't understand.


00:38:06.546 --> 00:38:08.215
Relax, l know.


00:38:08.215 --> 00:38:10.115
l spoke with the people
at the diving school.


00:38:10.183 --> 00:38:12.185
You don't need to know how to swim.


00:38:12.185 --> 00:38:14.050
At least you know how to drown.


00:38:14.121 --> 00:38:16.523
Listen, just keep quiet. Just...


00:38:16.523 --> 00:38:17.683
keep quiet.


00:38:18.692 --> 00:38:19.420
Kabir...


00:38:19.660 --> 00:38:21.855
l don't understand how you thought
l'll do this.


00:38:22.162 --> 00:38:23.288
What's wrong with you?


00:38:30.637 --> 00:38:31.831
Bathroom... to the left.


00:38:40.080 --> 00:38:40.876
Okay, listen.


00:38:41.381 --> 00:38:43.941
l know you're scared of water.


00:38:44.151 --> 00:38:44.480
Okay.


00:38:44.818 --> 00:38:47.844
But then that's the challenge.
And it's completely safe.


00:38:48.288 --> 00:38:49.656
Think about it.


00:38:49.656 --> 00:38:51.214
Blue waters... okay?


00:38:51.291 --> 00:38:52.918
Fish swimming close to you.


00:38:53.627 --> 00:38:54.787
Corals...


00:38:56.463 --> 00:38:57.487
lt'll be amazing.


00:39:01.868 --> 00:39:04.860
Look, if you're not comfortable,
no one's going to force you.


00:39:06.073 --> 00:39:08.064
No, l'm serious, it's okay.


00:39:08.508 --> 00:39:09.839
Okay. Fine.


00:39:22.956 --> 00:39:23.513
Kabir Dewan?


00:39:25.492 --> 00:39:26.560
Laila?


00:39:26.560 --> 00:39:27.049
Hey.


00:39:27.127 --> 00:39:28.526
Hi, what are you doing here?


00:39:29.162 --> 00:39:30.686
Following you, l guess.


00:39:31.531 --> 00:39:32.361
Really?


00:39:33.066 --> 00:39:34.090
No.


00:39:34.534 --> 00:39:36.434
l'm here to train you.


00:39:36.670 --> 00:39:37.534
l'm an instructor here.


00:39:38.071 --> 00:39:38.765
Wow!


00:39:39.673 --> 00:39:41.875
- Hi, l'm Kabir.
- Laila.


00:39:41.875 --> 00:39:43.274
- This is Arjun.
- Hi.


00:39:43.343 --> 00:39:43.809
Laila.


00:39:46.179 --> 00:39:46.702
Romeo?


00:39:47.714 --> 00:39:48.442
You remember?


00:39:50.517 --> 00:39:51.885
Arjun...


00:39:51.885 --> 00:39:55.343
lf you don't want to dive,
it's totally fine.


00:39:56.823 --> 00:39:57.881
He can't swim.


00:40:00.494 --> 00:40:01.825
lt's okay, doesn't matter.


00:40:02.462 --> 00:40:03.429
You'll be fine.


00:40:05.365 --> 00:40:05.990
Thank you.


00:40:07.367 --> 00:40:08.425
Shall we start?


00:40:09.136 --> 00:40:10.000
Let's go.


00:40:10.570 --> 00:40:12.595
lt's a little difficult to
talk under water.


00:40:12.672 --> 00:40:14.139
For obvious reasons.


00:40:14.341 --> 00:40:15.899
So these signs are very important.


00:40:17.377 --> 00:40:18.241
Up.


00:40:19.679 --> 00:40:20.941
Down.


00:40:21.715 --> 00:40:23.046
Okay.


00:40:23.850 --> 00:40:25.010
Not okay.


00:40:26.353 --> 00:40:27.513
Air guage.


00:40:29.322 --> 00:40:29.879
Okay?


00:40:31.992 --> 00:40:32.651
Okay?


00:40:35.061 --> 00:40:35.686
Alright!


00:40:38.298 --> 00:40:39.993
You have to wear a wet suit.


00:40:40.634 --> 00:40:41.658
The water is pretty cold.


00:40:42.903 --> 00:40:45.804
Next is the BCD.
Your buoyancy control device.


00:40:47.240 --> 00:40:48.264
All okay?


00:40:49.509 --> 00:40:52.137
These weights will help you
remain underwater.


00:40:59.019 --> 00:41:00.748
Finally, your fins.


00:42:31.144 --> 00:42:32.412
Cheers. Salut.


00:42:32.412 --> 00:42:33.310
Good job, boys.


00:42:39.219 --> 00:42:40.550
So, when is the wedding?


00:42:42.355 --> 00:42:43.390
ln two months.


00:42:43.390 --> 00:42:46.052
- That's like now, man.
- Yeah, l know.


00:42:46.126 --> 00:42:48.617
We only started dating
about six months ago.


00:42:49.062 --> 00:42:50.222
Well, you know what they say...


00:42:50.297 --> 00:42:51.321
when it's right, it's right.


00:42:51.698 --> 00:42:52.687
That's what l said.


00:42:53.300 --> 00:42:54.130
Actually, she said it.


00:42:57.337 --> 00:42:58.133
What does she do?


00:42:58.572 --> 00:43:00.403
lnterior design.
And she's bloody good.


00:43:01.074 --> 00:43:01.802
Okay.


00:43:01.875 --> 00:43:03.604
And of course,
her father has a hotel business...


00:43:03.677 --> 00:43:04.871
that's evaluated at...


00:43:05.645 --> 00:43:06.771
Ten billion?


00:43:07.247 --> 00:43:08.077
Ten billion.


00:43:09.349 --> 00:43:12.079
l'm not marrying her for her money.


00:43:12.152 --> 00:43:14.054
Kabir, of course not.


00:43:14.054 --> 00:43:16.113
But you've got to admit,
it's a plus point.


00:43:16.690 --> 00:43:19.181
Plus point?
Are you serious?


00:43:19.659 --> 00:43:22.219
Would you marry for money?


00:43:23.029 --> 00:43:23.893
Depends.


00:43:24.364 --> 00:43:25.262
How much?


00:43:27.300 --> 00:43:28.358
Ten billion!


00:43:29.336 --> 00:43:30.234
Definitely.


00:43:31.071 --> 00:43:32.936
And what if she's a bore?


00:43:34.474 --> 00:43:38.808
When you have ten billion in your bank
who needs the wife for entertainment?


00:43:38.979 --> 00:43:41.277
- Romantic.
- l agree, it's true.


00:43:41.648 --> 00:43:43.138
- Cheers!


00:43:45.952 --> 00:43:46.976
Are you seeing someone?


00:43:48.622 --> 00:43:49.748
Do you have a girlfriend?


00:43:50.390 --> 00:43:51.379
No.


00:43:52.959 --> 00:43:55.328
Hey... what about Rohini?
What happened there?


00:43:55.328 --> 00:43:57.397
- She was nice.
- Well...


00:43:57.397 --> 00:43:59.592
l guess she wanted
different things out of life.


00:44:00.333 --> 00:44:01.300
Laila...


00:44:02.068 --> 00:44:05.094
apart from my body
what else do you want out of life?


00:44:10.677 --> 00:44:13.976
l don't know.
l haven't really made a list.


00:44:14.314 --> 00:44:15.281
Still...


00:44:16.282 --> 00:44:17.772
there must be something.


00:44:20.720 --> 00:44:23.848
l guess, l want that...


00:44:24.224 --> 00:44:26.556
life should continue to surprise me.


00:44:27.160 --> 00:44:28.320
lnspire me.


00:44:30.463 --> 00:44:31.862
Make me meet new people.


00:44:32.032 --> 00:44:32.726
Hola.


00:44:34.167 --> 00:44:34.997
Hola.


00:44:35.969 --> 00:44:36.799
Hola?


00:44:37.537 --> 00:44:38.526
Sorry.


00:44:39.305 --> 00:44:40.602
Give me new experiences.


00:44:41.241 --> 00:44:42.265
And...


00:44:43.376 --> 00:44:44.502
l want...


00:44:45.879 --> 00:44:47.107
you to get me a drink.


00:44:49.616 --> 00:44:50.605
Your wish is my command.


00:44:50.784 --> 00:44:52.251
- One for me, please.
- Arjun?


00:44:53.019 --> 00:44:54.077
l'm okay.


00:45:01.194 --> 00:45:04.254
- Keep it down.
- Guys we're gonna get arrested.


00:45:08.535 --> 00:45:10.264
He's here. Quiet.


00:45:13.373 --> 00:45:14.863
l was just telling...


00:45:15.709 --> 00:45:18.371
that's the problem you see.


00:45:32.225 --> 00:45:33.249
Sorry.


00:45:57.383 --> 00:45:59.214
Your life is about to change.


00:46:01.721 --> 00:46:02.847
That's if l survive!


00:46:05.992 --> 00:46:06.981
We'll see.


00:46:10.563 --> 00:46:12.121
Yup, we'll see.


00:50:00.626 --> 00:50:03.151
The moment flows by like molten sapphire


00:50:05.498 --> 00:50:07.693
Deep blue silences


00:50:09.569 --> 00:50:12.470
No earth below, no sky above


00:50:14.807 --> 00:50:17.833
The rustling branches and leaves


00:50:19.979 --> 00:50:22.345
Are saying only you are here


00:50:24.784 --> 00:50:25.808
Only me


00:50:27.120 --> 00:50:29.111
My breath and my heartbeat


00:50:31.524 --> 00:50:34.357
Such depth, such solitude


00:50:36.029 --> 00:50:37.553
And me


00:50:37.964 --> 00:50:38.828
Only me


00:50:40.533 --> 00:50:42.865
I now believe I exist


00:50:55.848 --> 00:50:59.147
Baby, it was amazing.
You should definitely do it.


00:50:59.519 --> 00:51:01.180
l have no interest.


00:51:01.687 --> 00:51:02.555
Hey!


00:51:02.555 --> 00:51:03.214
Hey...


00:51:03.289 --> 00:51:05.757
Sorry. Can l use your loo?
lmran is taking a shower.


00:51:06.059 --> 00:51:06.684
Sure.


00:51:07.460 --> 00:51:08.324
Who is that?


00:51:08.728 --> 00:51:10.093
Wait. First say hi to Natasha.


00:51:11.497 --> 00:51:12.464
Okay.


00:51:13.399 --> 00:51:15.230
Hey... l'm Laila.


00:51:16.903 --> 00:51:17.597
Hi.


00:51:17.904 --> 00:51:20.236
Kabir has told me a lot about you.


00:51:20.306 --> 00:51:21.671
Congratulations in advance.


00:51:22.208 --> 00:51:23.106
Thanks.


00:51:23.509 --> 00:51:25.500
Well, it's really nice to meet you.


00:51:26.245 --> 00:51:28.270
- Bye.
- Bye.


00:51:30.149 --> 00:51:31.138
Who is that?


00:51:31.784 --> 00:51:33.152
That's Laila, our instructor.


00:51:33.152 --> 00:51:34.654
She's studying fashion in London but...


00:51:34.654 --> 00:51:37.557
three months a year she works
at dive sites around the world.


00:51:37.557 --> 00:51:38.724
lsn't that cool?


00:51:38.724 --> 00:51:39.559
Very cool.


00:51:39.559 --> 00:51:41.356
What is she doing in your room?


00:51:41.727 --> 00:51:43.092
She's using the bathroom.


00:51:46.699 --> 00:51:49.235
lmran invited her over for dinner.


00:51:49.235 --> 00:51:51.396
To celebrate our first dive.


00:51:51.838 --> 00:51:52.896
D'you think l'm stupid?


00:51:53.239 --> 00:51:55.139
What? lt's the truth.


00:51:55.208 --> 00:51:56.232
Arjun is cooking.


00:51:56.476 --> 00:51:58.637
Yeah, you must be very busy.
l'll speak to you later.


00:51:59.312 --> 00:52:00.870
Natasha, why are you getting upset?


00:52:01.180 --> 00:52:03.375
l'm not upset.
l've a flight to catch.


00:52:04.150 --> 00:52:05.481
You're being really silly.


00:52:05.618 --> 00:52:06.642
Yeah, l know. Bye.


00:52:09.055 --> 00:52:09.919
Bye.


00:52:13.292 --> 00:52:16.193
- All okay?
- Yeah, fine.


00:52:16.729 --> 00:52:18.594
- See you downstairs.
- See you.


00:52:29.642 --> 00:52:32.011
Need some help?


00:52:32.011 --> 00:52:33.706
Nope. Almost done.


00:52:37.450 --> 00:52:38.784
Paella.


00:52:38.784 --> 00:52:39.751
- Yup.
- Very nice.


00:52:40.453 --> 00:52:41.317
Thanks.


00:52:46.559 --> 00:52:47.526
So...


00:52:48.294 --> 00:52:49.852
you didn't tell me how it was.


00:52:53.065 --> 00:52:54.032
Thank you.


00:52:54.534 --> 00:52:57.367
Don't thank me.
You did it.


00:52:59.038 --> 00:53:02.007
So, how was it?


00:53:05.211 --> 00:53:06.542
lt was magical.


00:53:08.781 --> 00:53:11.306
lt felt like the
most peaceful place on earth.


00:53:13.819 --> 00:53:14.979
lt was beautiful.


00:53:16.656 --> 00:53:19.147
l was 16 when l did my first dive.


00:53:19.625 --> 00:53:22.526
And then stopping myself
was impossible.


00:53:23.396 --> 00:53:25.227
Yeah, it could be addictive.


00:53:25.698 --> 00:53:26.494
Addictive?


00:53:27.233 --> 00:53:28.222
No.


00:53:28.634 --> 00:53:30.192
Addiction is such a negative word.


00:53:30.870 --> 00:53:32.030
Diving is...


00:53:32.705 --> 00:53:34.002
something else for me.


00:53:34.507 --> 00:53:36.236
lt's like meditation.


00:53:37.476 --> 00:53:41.503
You're conscious of
every breath, every moment.


00:53:42.215 --> 00:53:43.614
Just imagine...


00:53:43.683 --> 00:53:46.015
living your whole life like that.


00:53:46.686 --> 00:53:49.086
Be fully alive to each and every moment.


00:53:53.226 --> 00:53:54.124
Delicious.


00:53:54.193 --> 00:53:55.057
- Seriously.
- Thank you.


00:53:55.127 --> 00:53:56.185
You should cook more often.


00:53:56.562 --> 00:53:57.586
l know man but...


00:53:57.964 --> 00:53:59.022
where's the time!


00:54:03.002 --> 00:54:05.129
So, the fear of water still there?


00:54:06.172 --> 00:54:07.139
Now there's no fear.


00:54:08.207 --> 00:54:09.231
Not even of life.


00:54:11.410 --> 00:54:14.038
Wow! ln one dunk
you've unravelled the mystery of life!


00:54:14.513 --> 00:54:15.241
Well done, my lad.


00:54:17.283 --> 00:54:18.773
Actually, it's quite simple.


00:54:20.019 --> 00:54:20.986
What is it?


00:54:23.522 --> 00:54:24.489
Just...


00:54:25.725 --> 00:54:26.692
keep breathing.


00:54:33.199 --> 00:54:34.393
Laila!


00:54:35.201 --> 00:54:37.601
Finally, our old friend has surfaced.


00:54:38.571 --> 00:54:40.596
And to avoid a relapse...


00:54:41.040 --> 00:54:43.099
why don't you join us on the trip?


00:54:43.743 --> 00:54:44.903
l'd love to.


00:54:44.977 --> 00:54:46.501
But l'm off to Bunol tomorrow.


00:54:46.912 --> 00:54:48.345
lt's the Tomatina festival.


00:54:48.514 --> 00:54:49.412
- Too bad!
- ls it?


00:54:49.482 --> 00:54:51.384
Toma-tina, what's that?


00:54:51.384 --> 00:54:52.715
Arjun!


00:54:53.185 --> 00:54:54.887
How can you not know that...


00:54:54.887 --> 00:54:58.448
it is world s largest tomato fight?!


00:55:00.626 --> 00:55:03.362
lt's like our festival of colours.
But played with tomatoes instead.


00:55:03.362 --> 00:55:04.363
Really?


00:55:04.363 --> 00:55:06.899
Actually, you guys should come.


00:55:06.899 --> 00:55:08.093
lt'll be a blast.


00:55:09.568 --> 00:55:10.091
l'm in.


00:55:10.503 --> 00:55:11.570
-Are you serious?
- Yeah, l'm in.


00:55:11.570 --> 00:55:13.299
What? No!


00:55:13.372 --> 00:55:14.573
We're leaving for Seville tomorrow.


00:55:14.573 --> 00:55:16.302
That's perfect.
Bunol is en-route.


00:55:16.809 --> 00:55:18.003
- Come on.


00:55:19.078 --> 00:55:21.444
Look, Seville is Arjun's choice.


00:55:22.214 --> 00:55:23.340
He made the reservations.


00:55:24.884 --> 00:55:27.876
To mess with Arjun's reservations is...


00:55:27.953 --> 00:55:29.420
like inviting Death!


00:55:35.628 --> 00:55:36.526
Come on.


00:55:40.700 --> 00:55:43.225
Alright, let me see what l can do.


00:55:47.073 --> 00:55:48.267
ls that your phone?


00:55:54.480 --> 00:55:55.469
lt's a long story.


00:55:56.382 --> 00:55:57.371
Let's not go there.


00:55:57.450 --> 00:55:58.747
No, it's nice.


00:55:59.719 --> 00:56:01.220
He's very much in touch
with his feminine side.


00:56:01.220 --> 00:56:02.278
Eat your food.


00:56:02.355 --> 00:56:04.857
Don't worry, even l like pink.


00:56:04.857 --> 00:56:06.256
Great, l feel much better.
Thank you.


00:56:14.367 --> 00:56:15.527
How could you do this?


00:56:16.035 --> 00:56:17.903
Rohini, l'm really sorry but...


00:56:17.903 --> 00:56:19.598
can't you see that
this deal could help me.


00:56:19.672 --> 00:56:21.401
Can't you see that maybe l don't care!


00:56:21.540 --> 00:56:22.742
You don't care.


00:56:22.742 --> 00:56:24.972
- You don't care about my life?
- Stop it, Arjun.


00:56:25.044 --> 00:56:27.444
Don't confuse your work with your life.


00:56:27.680 --> 00:56:30.706
Your work isn't your life.
lt's just a part of it.


00:56:31.050 --> 00:56:34.053
Just like this relationship
is a part of your life.


00:56:34.053 --> 00:56:35.953
- What about this?
- What about this?


00:56:36.489 --> 00:56:38.889
l bought this apartment so that
we could live together.


00:56:38.958 --> 00:56:40.860
What? Please!


00:56:40.860 --> 00:56:45.364
You bought this apartment to impress people
with your up market address.


00:56:45.364 --> 00:56:47.032
l can't believe you just said that.


00:56:47.032 --> 00:56:50.229
- l'm planning a future with you.
- Our future will come tomorrow, Arjun.


00:56:50.302 --> 00:56:52.338
- Don't scream!
- Where is our today?


00:56:52.338 --> 00:56:53.506
Don't scream.


00:56:53.506 --> 00:56:54.632
Then listen to me.


00:56:57.009 --> 00:56:58.067
What do you want?


00:56:58.544 --> 00:57:00.102
l want to spend time with you.


00:57:00.179 --> 00:57:03.716
l want a relationship.
Not a retirement plan.


00:57:03.716 --> 00:57:05.206
Please, Rohini.


00:57:05.885 --> 00:57:08.387
The chairman of Nakatomi Corporation
wants a meeting with me.


00:57:08.387 --> 00:57:10.116
What do l do?
l have to go.


00:57:11.690 --> 00:57:15.387
lf the presentation does it,
he'll give us the entire account.


00:57:15.461 --> 00:57:17.830
That will boost my career.


00:57:17.830 --> 00:57:19.388
Can't you see that?


00:57:19.465 --> 00:57:20.625
What about our deal?


00:57:21.734 --> 00:57:24.362
We can go next month.


00:57:25.337 --> 00:57:27.066
lt's my birthday, Arjun.


00:57:28.073 --> 00:57:31.042
- l know.
- lt won't come next month.


00:57:31.911 --> 00:57:36.177
You had promised that we would
go to ltaly no matter what.


00:57:36.882 --> 00:57:39.350
And you cancelled the tickets
without even talking to me.


00:57:41.954 --> 00:57:44.081
Rohini, l really am sorry.


00:57:45.057 --> 00:57:47.184
Please understand. Just a second.


00:57:48.461 --> 00:57:51.487
lt's an important call.
Just one second.


00:57:51.730 --> 00:57:53.197
Rohini, one second.
Hello...


00:57:55.668 --> 00:57:56.692
Yes, Alex...


00:57:57.803 --> 00:57:59.998
l'll be there in ten minutes.


00:58:23.829 --> 00:58:26.999
Hey babe, l guess you're on the plane.


00:58:26.999 --> 00:58:31.871
l called to say that we're going to
Bunol tomorrow, for the Tomatina festiva


00:58:31.871 --> 00:58:33.862
Laila is taking us.


00:58:34.573 --> 00:58:36.063
Please don't be upset.


00:58:37.910 --> 00:58:41.505
Please call when you get this message.
l love you.


00:58:47.119 --> 00:58:48.313
Where the hell is he?


00:58:56.395 --> 00:58:58.727
Oh - my - God!


00:59:05.204 --> 00:59:08.901
- l love it.
- Unbelievable!


00:59:08.974 --> 00:59:10.999
- Okay.
- Yes?


00:59:11.810 --> 00:59:13.038
- Can l drive?
- No.


00:59:14.046 --> 00:59:14.978
Kabira...


00:59:15.614 --> 00:59:18.851
if four days of diving
can do this to you.


00:59:18.851 --> 00:59:21.547
Trust me, you should stay under water.


00:59:21.820 --> 00:59:24.690
Who knows if l'll be with you guys again...


00:59:24.690 --> 00:59:26.892
l decided, it's all or bust!


00:59:26.892 --> 00:59:28.553
- Right?
- Correct.


00:59:28.627 --> 00:59:30.729
Dude, you're getting married.


00:59:30.729 --> 00:59:32.924
You're not going to prison.


00:59:32.998 --> 00:59:34.056
Thanks.


00:59:35.000 --> 00:59:36.024
All set?


00:59:36.302 --> 00:59:37.326
- Arjun...


00:59:37.703 --> 00:59:38.761
can you help me?


00:59:39.171 --> 00:59:41.574
- lt's to the right.
- lt's jammed, what did you do?


00:59:41.574 --> 00:59:42.302
Dude!


00:59:44.176 --> 00:59:45.700
You have to apply some force.


00:59:55.988 --> 00:59:56.955
- Hi.
- Hello.


00:59:58.958 --> 00:59:59.925
Child!


01:00:00.659 --> 01:00:01.827
Relax in the front seat.


01:00:01.827 --> 01:00:03.385
Driver... Bunol.


01:00:04.129 --> 01:00:07.030
So Lailaji, hale and hearty
both packed in the bag?


01:00:13.639 --> 01:00:14.606
No, thanks.


01:00:30.055 --> 01:00:31.613
What are you doing?


01:00:32.224 --> 01:00:35.625
Laila, meet Bagwati.


01:00:38.864 --> 01:00:40.354
Hi Bagwati.


01:00:43.636 --> 01:00:45.536
Bagwatithinks you are very beautiful.


01:00:46.305 --> 01:00:47.636
Thank you, Bagwati.


01:00:51.343 --> 01:00:52.833
The evening was hazy...


01:00:53.345 --> 01:00:55.506
The mood was sad...


