01:21:36.294 --> 01:21:38.785
And if you and Sameera
ever decide to go on a trip...


01:21:39.564 --> 01:21:40.758
why would I stop you?


01:21:40.965 --> 01:21:44.202
And if I told you
that weve met some guys...


01:21:44.202 --> 01:21:46.534
and made dinner plans
with them, then?


01:21:47.038 --> 01:21:47.902
Then what?


01:21:48.373 --> 01:21:49.203
Then what?


01:21:49.807 --> 01:21:51.743
I trust you.


01:21:51.743 --> 01:21:54.871
Of course Id want
you both to be safe...


01:21:55.546 --> 01:21:56.945
but besides that,
I wont suspect you.


01:21:57.015 --> 01:21:59.347
Im sorry, but its easier said than done.


01:22:01.519 --> 01:22:02.178
Babe...


01:22:04.022 --> 01:22:05.717
youre welcome to stay
if you want to.


01:22:05.790 --> 01:22:08.520
But if you don't,
III drive you to the airport tomorrow.


01:22:11.696 --> 01:22:12.594
Good night.


01:22:24.676 --> 01:22:26.837
- III miss you.
- Take care.


01:22:27.879 --> 01:22:29.779
Stay in touch. See at the wedding.


01:22:29.847 --> 01:22:31.405
- Imran, can you help me?
- Of course.


01:22:31.482 --> 01:22:32.684
For sure. Okay?


01:22:32.685 --> 01:22:34.385
- Email me.
- I will.


01:22:34.385 --> 01:22:35.215
Good luck.


01:22:38.356 --> 01:22:39.414
Hey...


01:22:44.562 --> 01:22:46.257
Yesterday was...


01:22:50.335 --> 01:22:51.825
I had the best time yesterday.


01:22:53.404 --> 01:22:54.530
Me too.


01:22:56.407 --> 01:22:58.242
And good luck...


01:22:58.242 --> 01:23:00.540
for your upcoming adventures.


01:23:02.647 --> 01:23:03.875
Thanks.


01:23:18.663 --> 01:23:19.630
III see you.


01:23:22.900 --> 01:23:23.559
Bye.


01:23:27.372 --> 01:23:28.339
Bye.


01:23:28.806 --> 01:23:29.670
Ciao.


01:23:53.698 --> 01:23:56.567
<i>A thought came alive, but away it hid.</i>


01:23:56.567 --> 01:23:59.297
<i>It stole a glance, from under the eyelids.</i>


01:23:59.370 --> 01:24:03.602
<i>Sometimes from you, sometimes from me</i>
it asked for words to set it free.


01:24:06.344 --> 01:24:09.714
<i>Words to wear, so from
the lips it can flee.</i>


01:24:09.714 --> 01:24:13.275
<i>A voice it can embrace and sway with glee.</i>


01:24:14.452 --> 01:24:18.286
<i>But this thought</i>
Is a feeling... just a feeling.


01:24:21.793 --> 01:24:24.091
<i>Like a fragrance floating in the breeze.</i>


01:24:24.796 --> 01:24:27.094
<i>A fragrance that is unspeaking.</i>


01:24:27.865 --> 01:24:30.535
<i>You live with it.</i>


01:24:30.535 --> 01:24:32.594
<i>I'm aware of it.</i>


01:24:33.237 --> 01:24:35.228
<i>Out in the open for the world to see.</i>


01:24:35.306 --> 01:24:37.536
<i>What is this unknown mystery?</i>


01:26:22.613 --> 01:26:23.602
Laila?


01:26:32.056 --> 01:26:33.353
Youll forgot something?


01:26:54.045 --> 01:26:55.774
I hate regrets.


01:26:58.449 --> 01:26:59.916
Then you shouldn't have any.


01:27:17.969 --> 01:27:18.958
Bye.


01:27:38.456 --> 01:27:42.693
<i>Flying away in the open sky...</i>


01:27:42.693 --> 01:27:46.993
<i>Are the birds of my dreams.</i>


01:27:49.734 --> 01:27:52.567
<i>Flying away...</i>


01:27:53.304 --> 01:27:58.003
<i>To the land of my heart</i>
are the birds of my dreams.


01:28:03.180 --> 01:28:08.550
<i>Don't know where they'll go next.</i>


01:28:11.622 --> 01:28:16.753
<i>Wings have taken flight and</i>
now says my sight you've finally awoken.


01:28:17.228 --> 01:28:22.427
<i>What was on your mind is left behind</i>
You've moved far ahead in time.


01:28:23.401 --> 01:28:28.395
<i>Life is floating on a breeze.</i>


01:28:29.073 --> 01:28:33.942
<i>Life is telling you and me.</i>


01:28:37.381 --> 01:28:41.750
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:29:19.390 --> 01:29:24.760
<i>A touch from someone</i>
and I've been wandering without a thought.


01:29:25.062 --> 01:29:31.235
<i>Somewhere new words were spoken</i>
and since then I've been lost.


01:29:31.235 --> 01:29:36.263
<i>Something made the heart melt.</i>


01:29:36.974 --> 01:29:41.775
<i>In a blink, I was someone else.</i>


01:29:45.182 --> 01:29:49.380
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:29:58.863 --> 01:30:07.271
<i>A light shone down</i> Now there's a
beauty being showered on the streets.


01:30:10.207 --> 01:30:18.740
<i>Happiness came down</i>
Now there's a zest being showered upon me.


01:30:20.117 --> 01:30:26.420
<i>Now I finally know who I was meant to be.</i>


01:30:29.860 --> 01:30:35.594
<i>Do you remember that moment yesterday</i>
The one with the magic force?


01:30:35.666 --> 01:30:41.730
<i>It transformed us into something new</i>
I wonder which moment it was?


01:30:41.806 --> 01:30:45.640
<i>The heart says just blindly go to.</i>


01:30:47.445 --> 01:30:52.178
<i>Any place that desire takes you.</i>


01:30:55.786 --> 01:31:01.782
<i>Now whatever will be will be.</i>


01:31:32.990 --> 01:31:33.088
What do you mean,
youve quit your job?


01:31:33.089 --> 01:31:34.825
What do you mean,
youve quit your job?


01:31:34.826 --> 01:31:36.060
Meaning?


01:31:36.060 --> 01:31:38.221
Were getting married in two months.


01:31:38.295 --> 01:31:40.525
So? You can resume after the wedding.


01:31:41.499 --> 01:31:42.523
How?


01:31:43.000 --> 01:31:44.558
First, well go on the honeymoon...


01:31:44.635 --> 01:31:47.238
then I want to redo the house.


01:31:47.238 --> 01:31:49.433
That will take about a year.


01:31:50.007 --> 01:31:52.576
And if youre going
to Singapore for your new project...


01:31:52.576 --> 01:31:54.407
