01:31:56.947 --> 01:31:57.982
But...


01:31:57.982 --> 01:32:00.314
that hotel is your dream project, Natasha.


01:32:00.651 --> 01:32:02.175
Dreams change baby.


01:32:03.120 --> 01:32:06.190
Then, I didn't know Id be getting married.


01:32:06.190 --> 01:32:07.157
Married?


01:32:08.392 --> 01:32:10.223
What does marriage have to do with it?


01:32:10.461 --> 01:32:12.229
What do you mean?


01:32:12.229 --> 01:32:13.856
Obviously, priorities change.


01:32:14.698 --> 01:32:18.225
After the wedding, even you wouldnt
want to go on this kind of boys holiday.


01:32:30.481 --> 01:32:32.642
- When is her flight?
- At 6 p.m.


01:32:35.486 --> 01:32:37.852
Dont worry man, well make it.


01:32:39.023 --> 01:32:39.853
Yeah.


01:32:45.629 --> 01:32:46.755
Very funny!


01:32:49.900 --> 01:32:50.730
All okay, babe?


01:32:51.335 --> 01:32:52.063
Yeah.


01:32:52.836 --> 01:32:54.030
Can I drive?


01:32:57.041 --> 01:32:58.770
Can you drive?


01:33:06.450 --> 01:33:09.987
Babe, the speed limit is 120.
You can go faster.


01:33:09.987 --> 01:33:12.148
Yes, we may just miss that flight.


01:33:12.890 --> 01:33:14.790
Im not going to drive rashly.


01:33:15.192 --> 01:33:16.352
Watch out!


01:33:18.329 --> 01:33:20.456
Please keep your eyes on the road, please!


01:33:21.031 --> 01:33:23.033
Then tell him not to talk to me.


01:33:23.033 --> 01:33:24.364
Dont talk to her.


01:33:29.540 --> 01:33:30.700
I love this song.


01:33:34.345 --> 01:33:37.872
Rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:40.951 --> 01:33:44.944
Im a rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:33:48.125 --> 01:33:52.152
Nothing rocks better than
a rock chick girl...


01:33:54.965 --> 01:33:59.265
Im a rock chick in a hard rock world...


01:34:03.407 --> 01:34:04.567
I had fun.


01:34:08.012 --> 01:34:08.876
Listen...


01:34:12.616 --> 01:34:13.640
Im sorry.


01:34:15.152 --> 01:34:16.016
Me too.


01:34:16.787 --> 01:34:18.015
