01:34:49.153 --> 01:34:51.781
If a friend doesn't address
a personal problem, then who will?


01:34:53.457 --> 01:34:54.858
Forget it man!


01:34:54.858 --> 01:34:57.190
Theyll sort their problem
and well get screwed in the middle.


01:34:57.327 --> 01:34:58.191
<i>Chee</i>, man!


01:34:58.962 --> 01:35:00.664
You are seriously shameless.


01:35:00.664 --> 01:35:01.528
What?


01:35:03.367 --> 01:35:05.736
Look... he is our friend.


01:35:05.736 --> 01:35:07.636
When he is back,
lets talk to him.


01:35:09.907 --> 01:35:10.703
Okay?


01:35:12.643 --> 01:35:13.200
Okay.


01:35:35.666 --> 01:35:36.394
God!


01:35:37.134 --> 01:35:38.192
Now what has he done?


01:35:39.303 --> 01:35:42.363
Hes buried inside his diary again.
Hes too boring.


01:35:42.806 --> 01:35:44.433
What do you write in it?


01:35:45.075 --> 01:35:45.871
Its private.


01:35:46.877 --> 01:35:47.809
Rascal...


01:35:48.479 --> 01:35:49.776
youve always been secretive.


01:35:50.147 --> 01:35:53.150
- But theres nothing to tell.
- No, no, no!


01:35:53.150 --> 01:35:55.380
Youre obviously struggling
with an emotional problem.


01:35:56.487 --> 01:35:58.216
