01:35:58.288 --> 01:35:59.455
Arjun...


01:35:59.456 --> 01:36:01.325
I truly believe that...


01:36:01.325 --> 01:36:05.318
if a friend doesn't address
a personal problem, then who will?


01:36:06.497 --> 01:36:08.532
