- Yes, absolutely.


01:36:08.532 --> 01:36:10.932
To figure out the problem
we have to do a test.


01:36:11.001 --> 01:36:12.836
- III say a word.
- Okay.


01:36:12.836 --> 01:36:16.897
And you have to say the first thing
that comes to your mind.


01:36:16.974 --> 01:36:18.575
Without deliberating.


01:36:18.575 --> 01:36:19.940
- Alright?
- Okay.


01:36:20.010 --> 01:36:21.671
- Ready, doctor.
- Fine.


01:36:22.112 --> 01:36:23.079
Car.


01:36:23.313 --> 01:36:24.214
Road.


01:36:24.214 --> 01:36:25.181
Arjun.


01:36:25.482 --> 01:36:26.346
Brother.


01:36:26.517 --> 01:36:27.381
Diary.


01:36:27.451 --> 01:36:28.284
Poetry.


01:36:28.285 --> 01:36:29.153
Heart.


01:36:29.153 --> 01:36:29.710
Love.


01:36:29.787 --> 01:36:30.654
Mumbai.


01:36:30.654 --> 01:36:31.522
Traffic.


01:36:31.523 --> 01:36:32.580
Father.


01:36:34.391 --> 01:36:35.358
- Father?
- Mother.


01:36:38.529 --> 01:36:40.588
According to my test...


01:36:40.664 --> 01:36:43.567
your father is the root of
your emotional problem.


01:36:43.567 --> 01:36:45.125
And youre keeping this from the world.


01:36:46.804 --> 01:36:50.073
And, in my opinion,
Dr. Sigmund <i>Fraud</i>...


01:36:50.073 --> 01:36:53.770
its time to shred your degree.
Please stop practicing, please!


01:36:54.044 --> 01:36:55.534
You hurt my feelings, man.


01:37:06.990 --> 01:37:07.786
My <i>bwoys</i>!


01:37:08.725 --> 01:37:11.285
If you want a view,
look that way.


01:37:20.237 --> 01:37:21.898
We should talk to him.


01:37:28.712 --> 01:37:32.049
Natasha is really sweet.
It was really nice to meet her.


01:37:32.049 --> 01:37:35.678
Yeah... even she was glad
to have met you.


01:37:38.722 --> 01:37:39.916
Kabir...


01:37:42.392 --> 01:37:44.792
- are you happy?
- Yes.


01:37:48.999 --> 01:37:51.832
Why... are you asking like this?


01:37:54.872 --> 01:37:57.067
I don't know man. Listen...


01:37:57.841 --> 01:38:00.002
its possible I may be wrong.


01:38:01.211 --> 01:38:04.908
But, we are friends.
And I just...


01:38:04.982 --> 01:38:06.108
