between Laila and me.


01:38:21.665 --> 01:38:22.563
Yeah.


01:38:23.300 --> 01:38:26.326
But, now theres no problem.
Thanks to you, my <i>bwoys</i>!


01:38:27.404 --> 01:38:28.632
Okay?


01:38:28.705 --> 01:38:29.899
Shes sweet.


01:38:30.407 --> 01:38:32.068
Imran, youve met her.
You spent time with her.


01:38:32.142 --> 01:38:33.006
Tell him.


01:38:33.410 --> 01:38:34.707
Yes, she is very sweet.


01:38:38.815 --> 01:38:40.048
Well thats good, man.


01:38:40.049 --> 01:38:40.880
Im happy for you.


01:38:46.657 --> 01:38:48.181
Hey... heres an extra pillow!


01:38:53.363 --> 01:38:54.523
Good night, <i>bwoys</i>.


01:38:55.732 --> 01:38:56.892
Good night.


01:39:11.715 --> 01:39:15.242
Guys, do you mind
if we take a detour?


01:39:16.286 --> 01:39:17.082
