01:39:17.521 --> 01:39:19.352
There is an artist, Salman Habib.


01:39:19.523 --> 01:39:22.693
He lives around here.
The lady at the gallery told me.


01:39:22.693 --> 01:39:24.752
That he sells his paintings from home.


01:39:25.462 --> 01:39:26.429
Really?


01:39:27.531 --> 01:39:28.429
Sounds good.


01:39:28.498 --> 01:39:30.796
Anyway, Im a bit bored
hanging with just the two of you.


01:39:48.151 --> 01:39:51.712
