01:40:13.176 --> 01:40:16.713
Dont feel like it.
Lets go to Seville.


01:40:16.713 --> 01:40:19.113
- Are you sure?
- Yeah.


01:40:19.182 --> 01:40:21.150
We can go on the way back.
Its okay.


01:40:22.452 --> 01:40:23.419
Okay!


01:40:24.554 --> 01:40:28.422
Its time to see
what Ive planned for us.


01:40:33.864 --> 01:40:35.832
Check it out, <i>bwoys</i>!


01:40:37.234 --> 01:40:39.532
Look at that guys!


01:40:40.704 --> 01:40:43.605
- Arjun, my pal. You rock!
