01:40:49.179 --> 01:40:50.407
Dont be silly.


01:40:51.014 --> 01:40:52.538
I want to do this.
Its my dream.


01:40:52.616 --> 01:40:54.243
- Yeah right!
- Just imagine...


01:40:55.018 --> 01:40:58.146
jumping from 15,000 feet
and flying towards the earth.


01:40:58.622 --> 01:41:00.249
Thats not flying, thats falling.


01:41:01.191 --> 01:41:02.158
It will be fun.


01:41:02.559 --> 01:41:03.548
Relax.


01:41:03.627 --> 01:41:05.629
Remember he eventually enjoyed diving.


01:41:05.629 --> 01:41:06.361
- Correct.
- Big deal.


01:41:06.362 --> 01:41:08.729
With a beautiful instructor
like Laila, who wouldnt!


01:41:09.366 --> 01:41:11.231
You never know,
you also might get lucky.


01:41:11.635 --> 01:41:14.971
You people ready to
jump out of a plane?


01:41:14.971 --> 01:41:15.960
Oh yeah!


01:41:16.206 --> 01:41:18.766
Are you ready to enter the air?


01:41:19.142 --> 01:41:20.131
Yeah!


01:41:23.480 --> 01:41:25.882
Head up. Eyes to the horizon.


01:41:25.882 --> 01:41:27.611
Legs at 45 degrees.


01:41:28.185 --> 01:41:30.415
Arch! Arch!


01:41:34.224 --> 01:41:35.623
- Did I say relax?
- No.


01:41:36.193 --> 01:41:39.720
I said arch. I didn't say relax.


01:41:51.808 --> 01:41:53.332
These are total malfunctions.


01:41:53.844 --> 01:41:56.813
In case of a total malfunction
what you have to do is this.


01:41:56.813 --> 01:41:58.974
Cut away your main and
deploy your reserve.


01:41:59.449 --> 01:42:01.076
What is that?
You have a malfunction.


01:42:03.954 --> 01:42:06.189
Cut away my main and
deploy my reserve.


01:42:06.189 --> 01:42:07.520
What are you doing?


01:42:08.358 --> 01:42:10.883
- Its a broken line.
- Are you sure its a broken line?


01:42:11.795 --> 01:42:14.958
Scissor kick... scissor kick...


01:42:15.732 --> 01:42:16.960
Cut! Deploy!


01:42:17.968 --> 01:42:18.832
Perfect!


01:42:23.874 --> 01:42:24.533
Whats this?


01:42:24.975 --> 01:42:25.907
Waiver form.


01:42:25.908 --> 01:42:26.637
Waiver form?


01:42:26.710 --> 01:42:30.043
If something happens to us... like death,
these guys arent responsible.


01:42:30.113 --> 01:42:31.681
We are responsible for it.


01:42:31.681 --> 01:42:32.409
What?


01:42:36.186 --> 01:42:37.210
