01:46:03.626 --> 01:46:04.991
Come on, Imran!


01:46:08.031 --> 01:46:09.157
Imran!


01:48:32.342 --> 01:48:35.869
<i>Who are you?</i>
Where have you been?


01:48:36.513 --> 01:48:39.073
<i>I've moved the heaven and the earth</i>
but I couldn't flnd you.


01:48:40.316 --> 01:48:43.649
<i>But you arrive today</i>,
so suddenly.


01:48:44.220 --> 01:48:47.246
<i>And you give meaning to</i>
my whole life with your love.


01:48:47.957 --> 01:48:49.584
<i>I don't understand.</i>


01:48:50.126 --> 01:48:51.787
<i>I don't know.</i>


01:48:52.161 --> 01:48:55.028
<i>What you've said to me, SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:48:55.732 --> 01:48:59.190
<i>Even then, I have no idea why.</i>


01:48:59.969 --> 01:49:03.166
<i>I like what I heard, SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:49:13.683 --> 01:49:16.015
<i>Don't look away.</i>


01:49:17.720 --> 01:49:19.881
<i>Stay close to me.</i>


01:49:21.558 --> 01:49:24.118
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:49:24.694 --> 01:49:27.390
<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:49:28.398 --> 01:49:31.526
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:49:33.136 --> 01:49:36.039
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:49:36.039 --> 01:49:39.167
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:49:40.877 --> 01:49:43.209
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:49:43.279 --> 01:49:47.079
<i>SeÃ±orita, listen to us</i>
SeÃ±orita, d'you hear what we're saying.


01:49:47.850 --> 01:49:50.978
<i>I will never understand.</i>


01:49:52.021 --> 01:49:55.081
<i>The meaning of the words</i>
you dedicate to me.


01:49:55.625 --> 01:49:58.594
<i>But the warmth of your gaze.</i>


01:49:59.829 --> 01:50:03.060
<i>Makes me feel like</i>
the most beautiful SeÃ±orita.


01:50:03.466 --> 01:50:07.704
<i>Our eyes looked at each other.</i>


01:50:07.704 --> 01:50:10.605
<i>And recounted tales of desire SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:50:11.307 --> 01:50:15.107
<i>That for affection and for love.</i>


01:50:15.345 --> 01:50:19.645
<i>There is only one language</i>
in the world SeÃ±orita.


01:50:20.149 --> 01:50:22.549
<i>Don't look away from me now.</i>


01:50:24.020 --> 01:50:26.181
<i>Come closer to me.</i>


01:50:27.790 --> 01:50:30.623
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:50:31.060 --> 01:50:34.393
<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:50:34.464 --> 01:50:37.922
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:50:39.469 --> 01:50:41.835
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:50:42.405 --> 01:50:46.205
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:50:47.310 --> 01:50:49.679
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:50:49.679 --> 01:50:54.048
<i>SeÃ±orita, listen to us</i>
SeÃ±orita, d'you hear what we're saying.


01:51:02.492 --> 01:51:04.983
<i>With every moment that has passed.</i>


01:51:06.996 --> 01:51:09.191
<i>Oh SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:51:10.900 --> 01:51:13.733
<i>You've managed to win my heart.</i>


01:51:14.137 --> 01:51:16.002
<i>And that's all there is to it.</i>


01:51:16.706 --> 01:51:18.731
<i>Don't look away.</i>


01:51:20.643 --> 01:51:22.804
<i>Stay close to me.</i>


01:51:24.347 --> 01:51:26.713
<i>Take me in your arms.</i>


01:51:27.684 --> 01:51:30.676
<i>Hope you've understood SeÃ±orita.</i>


01:51:31.154 --> 01:51:34.180
<i>Even a few moments of love.</i>


01:51:36.059 --> 01:51:38.084
<i>Are never too less.</i>


01:51:38.961 --> 01:51:42.488
<i>Come let's lose ourselves in them.</i>


01:51:43.866 --> 01:51:46.198
<i>And forget we ever knew sadness.</i>


01:52:25.675 --> 01:52:28.439
Remember before cable TV
we only had one national channel?


01:52:30.680 --> 01:52:33.205
And every Sunday
they showed a Hindi film.


01:52:34.617 --> 01:52:36.244
Get to the point.


01:52:37.720 --> 01:52:38.744
The point is...


01:52:39.622 --> 01:52:41.681
before the film there was this animation.


01:52:42.725 --> 01:52:45.216
A white circle went round and round
and formed the channel logo.


01:52:47.830 --> 01:52:49.024
Do you remember the tune?


01:53:09.218 --> 01:53:10.048
Brilliant!


01:53:21.798 --> 01:53:24.096
That tune never failed to depress me.


01:53:25.168 --> 01:53:26.157
Depressed.


01:53:27.904 --> 01:53:29.599
Im feeling the same right now.


01:53:32.742 --> 01:53:34.835
Weekends over and school begins.


01:53:35.278 --> 01:53:38.214
- And you wanted to cancel this trip!
- I know, man!


01:53:38.214 --> 01:53:39.442
Can you imagine?


01:53:43.452 --> 01:53:44.578
You know what that means?


01:53:46.055 --> 01:53:47.283
It means...


01:53:48.457 --> 01:53:50.618
that everything is predestined.


01:53:53.296 --> 01:53:54.354
Everything!


01:53:55.464 --> 01:53:58.922
This holiday was in our destiny.


01:54:00.136 --> 01:54:01.103
You know!


01:54:03.906 --> 01:54:05.703
You, me and asshole.


01:54:07.009 --> 01:54:08.670
- Cheers asshole.
- Wheres asshole?


01:54:10.813 --> 01:54:11.336
Cheers!


01:54:14.217 --> 01:54:15.707
Laila too.


01:54:19.789 --> 01:54:21.916
I was meant to meet her.


01:54:23.226 --> 01:54:24.591
You are in <i>louw</i>, my <i>bwoy</i>.


01:54:25.394 --> 01:54:26.520
No, man!


01:54:27.029 --> 01:54:28.394
You are in louw...


01:54:29.131 --> 01:54:30.399
You are in louw...


01:54:30.400 --> 01:54:33.266
- You are in <i>louw...</i>
- Kabir, man!


01:54:33.336 --> 01:54:35.702
Everything is written.
Listen to me.


01:54:35.905 --> 01:54:37.395
Its all predestined.


01:54:37.640 --> 01:54:38.474
You know what Im saying?


01:54:38.475 --> 01:54:40.642
This moment... us right now...


01:54:40.643 --> 01:54:42.111
its predestined.


01:54:42.111 --> 01:54:43.669
Predestined.


01:54:44.447 --> 01:54:46.472
Please stop saying, predestined...!


01:54:46.782 --> 01:54:48.306
I beg of you!


01:54:48.784 --> 01:54:51.319
This too is predestined.
Its all written.


01:54:51.320 --> 01:54:53.322
Alright, we get it.


01:54:53.322 --> 01:54:55.222
Listen, we get it, zip!


01:54:55.291 --> 01:54:56.451
Come on, man!


01:54:58.160 --> 01:54:59.127
Its true.


01:55:00.229 --> 01:55:01.397
Its predestined...


01:55:01.398 --> 01:55:02.295
Guys...


01:55:13.976 --> 01:55:14.840
Hola...


01:55:27.290 --> 01:55:28.780
Guys, watch out!


01:55:31.560 --> 01:55:32.618
What the hell, guys?


01:55:39.502 --> 01:55:40.298
Yes?


01:55:55.851 --> 01:55:58.721
- Our man is back.
- Their mobiles are switched off.


01:55:58.721 --> 01:55:59.710
- What?
- Yup.


01:55:59.789 --> 01:56:00.890
Even Nurias?


01:56:00.890 --> 01:56:02.448
Yes, Im shocked.


01:56:02.525 --> 01:56:05.585
When she knew wed land up in jail,
she shouldve kept the phone switched on.


01:56:06.963 --> 01:56:08.965
If our bail isnt posted...


01:56:08.965 --> 01:56:11.490
well be stuck here for days.


01:56:16.138 --> 01:56:17.002
Arjun...


01:56:18.674 --> 01:56:20.471
tell them I want to make a call.


01:56:21.510 --> 01:56:22.636
To whom?


01:56:23.713 --> 01:56:24.941
Salman Habib.


01:56:25.448 --> 01:56:26.472
The artist?


01:56:28.317 --> 01:56:29.011
Yeah.


01:56:30.386 --> 01:56:32.183
Why will he come to post our bail?


01:56:33.956 --> 01:56:35.116
Are you alright?


01:56:35.992 --> 01:56:38.394
Just because we cant reach anyone,
hes losing it.


01:56:38.395 --> 01:56:39.452
Hes my father.


01:56:40.329 --> 01:56:41.023
What?


01:56:43.499 --> 01:56:44.625
I am his son.


01:56:54.977 --> 01:56:56.171
Just let it go Imran.


01:56:58.848 --> 01:56:59.906
Just let it go.


01:57:00.483 --> 01:57:01.142
Hello...


01:57:02.518 --> 01:57:03.886
Hello, may I...


01:57:03.886 --> 01:57:06.047
speak with Mr. Salman Habib, please?


01:57:06.789 --> 01:57:07.517
Yes?


01:57:09.158 --> 01:57:10.887
Sir, I am Imran.


01:57:12.828 --> 01:57:15.319
I am Rahilas son.


01:57:19.635 --> 01:57:21.102
When did you find out?


01:57:24.407 --> 01:57:26.307
Afew days after Abu died.


01:57:29.111 --> 01:57:32.569
In his stuff, I found a letter
that Ammi had written to him.


01:57:34.016 --> 01:57:35.745
The letter stated that...


01:57:35.818 --> 01:57:41.518
Ammi was grateful that Abu had
accepted her and her unborn child.


01:57:44.860 --> 01:57:46.418
Why didn't you tell us?


01:57:49.465 --> 01:57:50.796
I was a bit shaken up.


01:57:52.535 --> 01:57:55.060
What would I tell you?
<i>Abu is not my father.</i>


01:57:57.706 --> 01:57:59.674
He loved you a lot.


01:58:01.210 --> 01:58:02.837
He really loved you.


01:58:04.780 --> 01:58:06.111
And us.


01:58:06.816 --> 01:58:08.817
I mean, think about it.


01:58:08.818 --> 01:58:11.353
Be it sports day or
parent-teacher meetings...


01:58:11.353 --> 01:58:14.686
our fathers seldom came,
but Abu was always there.


01:58:16.325 --> 01:58:18.520
Well, my father was dead.


01:58:19.028 --> 01:58:22.361
So, if he showed up for sports day
it wouldve been a bit strange.


01:58:29.305 --> 01:58:30.704
Youve got bail.


01:58:33.976 --> 01:58:35.273
Theyre here.


01:58:46.989 --> 01:58:47.853
Hi.


01:58:50.893 --> 01:58:51.689
Imran.


01:58:53.896 --> 01:58:54.863
Imran...


01:58:56.132 --> 01:58:56.996
Im Salman.


01:59:01.670 --> 01:59:03.739
My friends, Arjun and Kabir.


01:59:03.739 --> 01:59:04.933
- Hello.
- Thank you.


01:59:05.007 --> 01:59:06.304
Hi... thank you.


01:59:07.243 --> 01:59:09.234
You three look pretty hungover.


01:59:12.548 --> 01:59:15.346
Youre welcome to come over to
my place and freshen up.


01:59:16.018 --> 01:59:18.748
Our bags and car are at the hotel.


01:59:18.954 --> 01:59:20.353
III drive you there.


01:59:22.191 --> 01:59:22.885
Come.


01:59:37.873 --> 01:59:39.898
Wow, this is beautiful.


01:59:41.644 --> 01:59:42.668
Its really nice.


01:59:43.879 --> 01:59:46.074
Are you always so polite?


01:59:47.550 --> 01:59:50.849
Its absolute rubbish.
Anyone can do that.


01:59:51.654 --> 01:59:54.155
This gentleman, my neighbour...


01:59:54.156 --> 01:59:57.359
was obsessed with having his wife
immortalised in a potrait.


01:59:57.359 --> 02:00:00.886
So, I applied my brush
and fulfilled his desire.


02:00:00.963 --> 02:00:03.295
And with his money, paid my bills.


02:00:05.668 --> 02:00:08.000
So, what are you guys doing in Seville?


02:00:08.704 --> 02:00:10.072
Skydiving.


02:00:10.072 --> 02:00:11.232
- Really?
- Yeah.


02:00:11.307 --> 02:00:13.434
So, you jumped out of a plane
and landed in jail?


02:00:14.710 --> 02:00:16.075
You could say that.


02:00:16.545 --> 02:00:20.675
That apart, what do you do?


02:00:21.650 --> 02:00:23.277
Well, Im a financial broker.


02:00:23.652 --> 02:00:24.619
In London.


02:00:25.120 --> 02:00:26.178
Money man.


02:00:27.623 --> 02:00:28.351
And you?


02:00:28.991 --> 02:00:30.686
My family is in the construction business.


02:00:31.727 --> 02:00:34.093
Well, never mind.
Everyone makes mistakes.


02:00:35.064 --> 02:00:35.860
Thats funny.


02:00:36.498 --> 02:00:38.489
Youre a Xerox copy of him.


02:00:42.204 --> 02:00:43.899
And, what about you?


02:00:45.307 --> 02:00:46.205
I write.


02:00:47.876 --> 02:00:48.433
What?


02:00:49.311 --> 02:00:51.040
Im a copywriter in advertising.


02:00:52.114 --> 02:00:55.174
Writing copy for ads is like
a buffet for the masses.


02:00:55.551 --> 02:00:58.247
For instance, this painting is
for someone else.


02:00:59.688 --> 02:01:02.486
Do you write anything
to feed your own soul?


02:01:04.193 --> 02:01:05.524
I do.


02:01:10.332 --> 02:01:11.132
Sir?


02:01:11.200 --> 02:01:12.030
Salman.


02:01:12.735 --> 02:01:14.464
Right. Well be outside.


02:01:31.954 --> 02:01:35.117
Your hands are very similar to mine.


02:01:38.527 --> 02:01:39.494
Sit.


02:01:43.232 --> 02:01:44.130
Do you live alone?


02:01:44.633 --> 02:01:45.600
No.


02:01:46.302 --> 02:01:47.166
I have a wife.


02:01:47.536 --> 02:01:49.663
But she is away... in Paris.


02:01:50.172 --> 02:01:50.866
Sit.


02:01:53.976 --> 02:01:54.908
And any...


02:01:55.144 --> 02:01:56.304
children?


02:02:02.885 --> 02:02:04.113
Do you ever come to India?


02:02:05.154 --> 02:02:06.221
Yes.


02:02:06.221 --> 02:02:09.088
I was there four years ago
when my mother passed away.


02:02:10.459 --> 02:02:12.161
- Sorry.
- I have a brother there...


02:02:12.162 --> 02:02:13.128
but...


02:02:14.730 --> 02:02:16.027
we don't meet.


02:02:21.637 --> 02:02:24.003
Ive often thought about you.


02:02:25.974 --> 02:02:26.998
I mean...


02:02:28.477 --> 02:02:32.937
that someday, somewhere we might meet.


02:02:34.616 --> 02:02:37.052
But I never figured...


02:02:37.052 --> 02:02:39.612
what I would say to you.


02:02:41.290 --> 02:02:42.450
Just say the truth.


02:02:45.227 --> 02:02:47.422
The truth... what is the truth?


02:02:48.664 --> 02:02:51.224
Everyone has their own version.


02:02:56.572 --> 02:02:58.741
Look... I was...


02:02:58.741 --> 02:03:00.606
25 then.


02:03:01.777 --> 02:03:04.746
Rahila was a few years younger.


02:03:06.148 --> 02:03:08.884
When youre young
the future doesn't matter.


02:03:08.884 --> 02:03:10.511
We were just kids.


02:03:13.155 --> 02:03:15.214
One day...


02:03:15.290 --> 02:03:17.781
Rahila told me that shes...


02:03:18.394 --> 02:03:21.261
expecting a baby.


02:03:21.330 --> 02:03:24.231
I wasnt ready for
the responsibility then.


02:03:24.299 --> 02:03:26.199
And nor am I now.


02:03:32.708 --> 02:03:35.643
So... you just abandoned her?


02:03:39.515 --> 02:03:42.507
I guess, you could say that.


02:03:47.689 --> 02:03:52.217
Rahila wanted a family,
she wanted to be a mother.


02:03:53.529 --> 02:03:56.157
I had other dreams.
I wanted to be an artist.


02:03:57.166 --> 02:03:59.168
I wanted to paint...


02:03:59.168 --> 02:04:00.635
travel the world.


02:04:02.171 --> 02:04:04.573
I loved her but...


02:04:04.573 --> 02:04:07.599
she made her choice
and I made mine.


02:04:07.676 --> 02:04:09.473
Thats all.


02:04:13.382 --> 02:04:15.612
I found out about you
only last year.


02:04:19.555 --> 02:04:20.522
But...


02:04:22.224 --> 02:04:24.852
youve always known about me.


02:04:26.695 --> 02:04:29.357
Did you never want to see me?


02:04:31.500 --> 02:04:33.400
I thought it was better this way.


02:04:41.376 --> 02:04:43.867
You asked for the truth.


02:04:45.280 --> 02:04:46.406
Well, this is it.


02:04:49.151 --> 02:04:50.516
I... am sorry, Imran.


02:04:52.454 --> 02:04:53.478
No, youre not.


02:04:58.393 --> 02:05:00.793
Is there something
I can do for you?


02:05:02.364 --> 02:05:05.356
Apologise only when it comes from here.


02:05:28.624 --> 02:05:31.593
<i>When clouds of pain loom in the sky.</i>


02:05:32.294 --> 02:05:35.263
<i>When a shadow of sadness flickers by.</i>


02:05:36.064 --> 02:05:39.033
<i>When a tear flnds it's way to the eye.</i>


02:05:39.401 --> 02:05:42.370
<i>When fear keeps the loneliness alive.</i>


02:05:43.372 --> 02:05:48.010
<i>I try and console my heart</i>
Why is it that you cry? I ask.


02:05:48.010 --> 02:05:50.535
<i>This is only what life imparts.</i>


02:05:51.280 --> 02:05:53.680
<i>These deep silences within.</i>


02:05:54.182 --> 02:05:56.810
<i>Have been handed out to all by time.</i>


02:05:58.053 --> 02:06:00.544
<i>Everyone's story has a little sorrow.</i>


02:06:01.123 --> 02:06:03.785
<i>Everyone's share has a little Sunshine.</i>


02:06:05.160 --> 02:06:07.219
<i>No need for water in your eyes.</i>


02:06:08.630 --> 02:06:10.928
<i>Every moment can be a new life.</i>


02:06:12.334 --> 02:06:14.529
<i>Why do you let them pass you by.</i>


02:06:16.004 --> 02:06:17.972
<i>Oh heart, why is it that you cry?</i>


02:06:27.215 --> 02:06:28.375
Morning...


02:06:34.623 --> 02:06:35.647
Did you sleep or not?


02:06:37.292 --> 02:06:38.020
No.


02:06:47.202 --> 02:06:49.830
I think, we should get going.


02:06:51.540 --> 02:06:52.529
Lets go.


02:06:53.976 --> 02:06:54.601
Arjun...


02:06:58.780 --> 02:07:00.611
Im really sorry.


02:07:25.507 --> 02:07:26.565
III see you at the car.


02:07:26.808 --> 02:07:27.638
Yeah.


02:07:31.780 --> 02:07:33.680
What do you mean,
you slept in the car?


02:07:34.449 --> 02:07:35.746
Long story, babe.


02:07:36.818 --> 02:07:37.842
Tell me, what happened?


02:07:39.121 --> 02:07:41.089
Well, Imran just...


02:07:43.025 --> 02:07:44.185
III tell you later, okay.


02:07:45.060 --> 02:07:46.789
Why? Tell me now,
what happened?


02:07:47.129 --> 02:07:50.098
I cant tell you right now.
III tell you when Im back.


02:07:50.465 --> 02:07:51.932
Why are you getting irritated?


02:07:52.200 --> 02:07:54.065
Why are you going on about it?


02:07:54.302 --> 02:07:55.599
Okay, forget it.


02:08:00.042 --> 02:08:00.974
See.


02:08:01.343 --> 02:08:02.970
Its our wedding card.
Can you see it?


02:08:03.378 --> 02:08:04.777
Isnt it gorgeous?


02:08:05.313 --> 02:08:06.940
Im just so happy with it.


02:08:07.783 --> 02:08:10.385
Oh... Ive emailed a few options
for your suit.


02:08:10.385 --> 02:08:13.081
Please select one. Okay?
Dont forget.


02:08:13.555 --> 02:08:14.453
Okay.


02:08:16.692 --> 02:08:18.887
You are so far away.


02:08:20.195 --> 02:08:21.662
You love me, right?


02:08:23.031 --> 02:08:23.998
Yeah.


02:08:24.700 --> 02:08:26.565
Then stop fighting with me.


02:08:27.402 --> 02:08:30.530
Everything was fine before you
went on this holiday.


02:08:31.206 --> 02:08:33.003
Kabir, just come home.


02:08:33.508 --> 02:08:36.944
To me, your family, your friends.


02:08:37.345 --> 02:08:39.142
My friends are with me.


02:08:39.448 --> 02:08:41.416
Yeah, I know.
But you know what I mean.


02:08:52.994 --> 02:08:59.900
Happy birthday to you...


02:09:00.869 --> 02:09:04.498
Happy birthday dear Anjali...


02:09:05.173 --> 02:09:07.698
Happy birthday to you...


02:09:14.349 --> 02:09:15.247
Oh my God!


02:09:16.284 --> 02:09:17.478
Its beautiful!


02:09:17.853 --> 02:09:18.911
- Nice, right?
- Yes!


02:09:21.022 --> 02:09:21.886
Tanya?


02:09:32.033 --> 02:09:33.193
What are you doing, baby?


02:09:33.802 --> 02:09:35.201
Im sorry, Im so happy.


02:09:35.670 --> 02:09:37.900
Kabir just proposed to Natasha.


02:09:37.973 --> 02:09:39.206
What??


02:09:39.207 --> 02:09:41.208
Oh my God!


02:09:41.209 --> 02:09:43.879
You couldve waited until
your mother had cut the cake.


02:09:43.879 --> 02:09:46.871
Kabir, this is the best
birthday gift, ever!


02:09:46.948 --> 02:09:48.049
I love you, son.


02:09:48.050 --> 02:09:49.107
The shy guy!


02:09:49.785 --> 02:09:51.887
Its a double celebration.


02:09:51.887 --> 02:09:53.354
Im so happy.


02:09:54.122 --> 02:09:55.111
Now you have to call me mummy.


02:09:56.625 --> 02:09:58.490
Get some champagne!


02:10:01.196 --> 02:10:02.196
Come here.


02:10:04.199 --> 02:10:05.598
Very good decision.


02:10:07.836 --> 02:10:09.804
Im so happy.


02:10:11.072 --> 02:10:13.597
Babe, what just happened in there?


02:10:13.675 --> 02:10:15.973
- What do you mean?
- I mean...


02:10:16.478 --> 02:10:18.213
This ring...


02:10:18.213 --> 02:10:19.612
I got it for my mom.


02:10:21.616 --> 02:10:23.413
Its her birthday gift.


02:10:24.019 --> 02:10:25.077
This is for your mom?


02:10:25.720 --> 02:10:28.587
Look at it sweety...
its a mummy ring.


02:10:28.657 --> 02:10:30.058
What?


02:10:30.058 --> 02:10:31.423
Why didn't you say something?


02:10:31.893 --> 02:10:33.417
I tried.


02:10:33.495 --> 02:10:37.397
But you were excited and screaming.
And Tanya made an announcement.


02:10:38.066 --> 02:10:40.227
So you don't want to marry me?


02:10:40.669 --> 02:10:44.196
Its not about you.
I havent even thought about marriage.


02:10:46.875 --> 02:10:48.672
What do I tell my father?


02:10:53.648 --> 02:10:56.551
Well say that
we gave it some more thought and...


02:10:56.551 --> 02:10:58.951
we need more time. Thats all.


02:10:59.020 --> 02:11:00.647
This is so embarrassing.


02:11:01.489 --> 02:11:03.548
Im so sorry, sweety.


02:11:04.492 --> 02:11:07.188
You don't ever want to marry me?


02:11:08.463 --> 02:11:10.298
Its not like that.


02:11:10.298 --> 02:11:12.823
If it is, you better tell me right now!


02:11:14.135 --> 02:11:16.838
I really love you, Kabir.
And I don't...


02:11:16.838 --> 02:11:20.069
No, no... no sweety. Dont cry.


02:11:20.141 --> 02:11:21.073
Not now.


02:11:28.450 --> 02:11:29.178
Kabir...


02:11:31.119 --> 02:11:34.816
are you even serious
about this relationship or not?


02:11:38.159 --> 02:11:38.989
You know what...


02:11:50.038 --> 02:11:51.062
Will you marry me?


02:12:15.196 --> 02:12:16.254
Who is it?


02:12:31.146 --> 02:12:32.010
Room service.


02:12:33.214 --> 02:12:33.839
Laila?


02:12:34.883 --> 02:12:35.907
Hi!


02:12:35.984 --> 02:12:36.814
Oh my God!


02:12:38.219 --> 02:12:39.686
Youre here... how... I mean...


02:12:40.121 --> 02:12:42.817
Imran called and
he begged me to come.


02:12:43.158 --> 02:12:44.352
- So I came.
- Imran?


02:12:44.826 --> 02:12:45.850
I knew it.


02:12:46.528 --> 02:12:48.086
He is my best friend.


02:12:51.232 --> 02:12:53.393
I am... so glad youre here.


02:12:54.836 --> 02:12:56.497
Im glad you are glad.


02:12:59.174 --> 02:13:01.335
Hello... my <i>the</i> two <i>the</i> love <i>the</i> birds!


02:13:01.810 --> 02:13:03.141
Hello!


02:13:03.278 --> 02:13:04.336
Surprised, Arjun?


02:13:05.647 --> 02:13:06.705
Thank you.


02:13:06.781 --> 02:13:08.183
Its good to see you.


02:13:08.183 --> 02:13:09.377
- And you.
- Hey gorgeous.


02:13:09.451 --> 02:13:11.519
- I love you too.
- Nice to have you back.


02:13:11.519 --> 02:13:12.884
You got a tan!


02:13:13.655 --> 02:13:14.654
Get dressed, soon!


02:13:14.655 --> 02:13:15.989
- We had to leave at seven.
- Correct.


02:13:15.990 --> 02:13:17.192
- Two minutes?
- You missed me?


02:13:17.193 --> 02:13:18.860
I always miss you, darling.


02:13:18.860 --> 02:13:19.884
Where are we going?


02:13:19.961 --> 02:13:21.588
Its a surprise.
Cant tell you in front of him.


02:13:39.647 --> 02:13:40.807
Whats going on?


02:13:41.216 --> 02:13:42.274
What do you mean?


02:13:42.517 --> 02:13:43.575
Its San Fermin.


02:13:43.651 --> 02:13:44.684
Running with the bulls.


02:13:44.685 --> 02:13:46.085
- Really?
- Didnt you know?


02:13:46.154 --> 02:13:47.280
Just follow me...


02:13:55.563 --> 02:13:56.621
Holy shit!


02:14:03.671 --> 02:14:05.298
Are these guys mad?
What are they doing?


02:14:05.540 --> 02:14:06.336
Suicide.


02:14:06.875 --> 02:14:08.240
Isnt that why you are here?


02:14:18.953 --> 02:14:21.012
I felt this should be the
last experience of our trip.


02:14:21.723 --> 02:14:24.191
This could be the
<i>last</i> experience of our life!


02:14:24.526 --> 02:14:26.694
Stop it, Arjun.
Lets grab a bite.


02:14:26.694 --> 02:14:27.251
Come on.


02:14:28.329 --> 02:14:29.397
- Excuse me.
- Dude are you...


02:14:29.398 --> 02:14:30.625
Im starving!


02:14:32.233 --> 02:14:33.723
This is not an adventure sport.


02:14:34.402 --> 02:14:35.699
I object, Judge <i>sahab</i>!


02:14:36.337 --> 02:14:38.505
I agree its not as safe as regular sports.


02:14:38.506 --> 02:14:40.075
And is illegal in some countries.


02:14:40.075 --> 02:14:42.873
But according to the
Spanish tradition and culture...


02:14:42.944 --> 02:14:43.876
it is allowed.


02:14:43.877 --> 02:14:45.869
And technically,
according to our deal...


02:14:45.947 --> 02:14:48.347
we can choose any sport, remember?


02:14:48.683 --> 02:14:50.185
Imran, its really dangerous, you know.


02:14:50.186 --> 02:14:52.380
Yes, those bulls could kill us, alright?


02:14:52.620 --> 02:14:55.290
Well be dangling on their horns
like tandoori chicken on skewers!


02:14:55.290 --> 02:14:57.019
Precisely the point.


02:14:58.159 --> 02:15:00.218
You want to get rid of
the fear within you?


02:15:00.495 --> 02:15:02.656
Well then, heres
our deepest fear. Death.


02:15:03.698 --> 02:15:04.722
Lets face it.


02:15:05.333 --> 02:15:06.699
Because beyond this fear...


02:15:06.700 --> 02:15:07.599
lies victory!


02:15:07.669 --> 02:15:09.694
Please spare us the tag lines!


02:15:10.138 --> 02:15:11.833
Dude, think about it!


02:15:12.073 --> 02:15:15.702
No training, no instructors.
Just us, my amigos!


02:15:16.444 --> 02:15:18.241
And some bulls running after us.


02:15:18.480 --> 02:15:20.778
If you want to live... just run!


02:15:21.182 --> 02:15:23.343
Laila, do you know
any psychiatrist around here?


02:15:24.119 --> 02:15:26.349
Because our amigo has
completely lost it!


02:15:27.188 --> 02:15:29.213
III be at the starting line
at seven tomorrow morning.


02:15:29.858 --> 02:15:31.826
With or without you.


02:15:37.365 --> 02:15:37.763
I have something for you, Imran.


02:15:37.764 --> 02:15:38.754
I have something for you, Imran.


02:15:39.634 --> 02:15:40.464
Its from Nuria.


02:15:44.239 --> 02:15:45.035
Its in Spanish.


02:15:46.007 --> 02:15:47.269
Love has no language.


02:15:47.876 --> 02:15:48.570
So true.


02:15:51.613 --> 02:15:52.944
I think you should
buy her something.


02:15:53.781 --> 02:15:54.611
Youre absolutely right.


02:15:55.183 --> 02:15:56.741
Guys... next stop - shopping.


02:15:58.186 --> 02:15:59.744
Count me out,
Im going back to the hotel.


02:16:00.822 --> 02:16:01.948
Are you alright?


02:16:04.325 --> 02:16:05.155
Im fine.


02:16:06.027 --> 02:16:07.995
That well only know after a test.


02:16:08.863 --> 02:16:09.659
Test?


02:16:10.899 --> 02:16:12.127
What do you say, Dr. <i>Fraud?</i>.


02:16:13.034 --> 02:16:13.728
Are you game?


02:16:14.335 --> 02:16:15.063
Bring it on.


02:16:15.737 --> 02:16:16.931
You have to say the first thing...


02:16:17.005 --> 02:16:18.973
I know the drill. Ask!


02:16:19.874 --> 02:16:20.602
Black.


02:16:20.842 --> 02:16:21.399
Night.


02:16:21.476 --> 02:16:22.340
Sea.


02:16:22.510 --> 02:16:23.238
Salty.


02:16:23.311 --> 02:16:24.144
Work.


02:16:24.145 --> 02:16:25.146
Money.


02:16:25.146 --> 02:16:26.010
Sex.


02:16:26.214 --> 02:16:27.048
I like!


02:16:27.048 --> 02:16:27.571
Friend.


02:16:27.949 --> 02:16:28.677
You.


02:16:28.883 --> 02:16:29.850
Marriage.


02:16:31.186 --> 02:16:32.346
Family.


02:16:39.194 --> 02:16:40.024
What?


02:16:41.829 --> 02:16:43.331
Is that all?


02:16:43.331 --> 02:16:44.628
It was enough.


02:16:46.501 --> 02:16:48.169
Smartass...


02:16:48.169 --> 02:16:51.866
Youre using my trick on me?
Just say what you want to.


02:16:52.407 --> 02:16:53.305
Okay.


02:16:54.042 --> 02:16:56.442
You hesitated on marriage.


02:16:56.878 --> 02:16:58.277
So?


02:16:58.346 --> 02:17:01.804
Im just saying...
you hesitated... on marriage.


02:17:05.787 --> 02:17:06.651
Look...


02:17:07.655 --> 02:17:11.182
I don't have the time for this crap.
See you later.


02:17:14.963 --> 02:17:17.591
- Okay.
- Im sorry, Im going to...


02:17:25.506 --> 02:17:26.473
Kabir.


02:17:31.613 --> 02:17:32.409
Go!


02:17:35.316 --> 02:17:36.442
Kabir!


02:17:37.452 --> 02:17:38.919
Kabir... man, just stop!


02:17:39.621 --> 02:17:40.747
What?


02:17:41.856 --> 02:17:43.721
Talk to us man. Whats going on?


02:17:44.125 --> 02:17:45.990
Its nothing, really.


02:17:47.962 --> 02:17:48.929
Kabir...


02:17:50.898 --> 02:17:53.196
Look, Im sorry I lost my cool.


02:17:54.502 --> 02:17:56.834
Because I said you have
a problem with marriage?


02:17:57.705 --> 02:18:00.970
I guess, Im freaking out.
I don't know whats happening.


02:18:01.376 --> 02:18:03.710
Its normal to be nervous.


02:18:03.711 --> 02:18:06.214
Its not like youre having
an arranged marriage.


02:18:06.214 --> 02:18:08.876
Yeah, but she isnt
the same person I met.


02:18:09.550 --> 02:18:11.711
Shes changed,
shes become possessive.


02:18:12.320 --> 02:18:15.619
The girl I knew was a
talented, independent interior designer.


02:18:15.790 --> 02:18:17.825
She enjoyed her work.


02:18:17.825 --> 02:18:18.792
But now...


02:18:19.360 --> 02:18:21.328
shes bid adieu to her passion and...


02:18:21.562 --> 02:18:23.462
taken over my life.


02:18:24.399 --> 02:18:26.401
Of course, I want a partner but...


02:18:26.401 --> 02:18:28.096
I want my own life too!


02:18:28.403 --> 02:18:32.203
The whole <i>two bodies, one soul</i> thing
I wont be able to handle it.


02:18:42.884 --> 02:18:44.875
- May I ask you something?
- Yes.


02:18:46.187 --> 02:18:48.417
Dont you think
you proposed to her too soon?


02:18:49.157 --> 02:18:51.325
Actually, I didn't even propose.


02:18:51.326 --> 02:18:52.894
What?


02:18:52.894 --> 02:18:55.226
Id bought a ring for my mom
as a birthday gift.


02:18:55.496 --> 02:18:58.897
Before giving it, I happened to show
it to Natasha and she thought...


02:18:59.334 --> 02:19:00.801
it was meant for her.


02:19:02.570 --> 02:19:04.265
- Are you crazy?
- What are you doing?


02:19:04.739 --> 02:19:06.536
- Whats wrong with him?
- What's wrong with him?


02:19:11.846 --> 02:19:14.212
No wonder this vacation was
so important for you.


02:19:14.949 --> 02:19:15.608
Meaning?


02:19:16.718 --> 02:19:19.949
Basically, you wanted to hear from someone
else that you shouldn't get married.


02:19:20.154 --> 02:19:22.856
And besides us,
who wouldve told you this.


02:19:22.857 --> 02:19:24.726
Have you totally lost it?


02:19:24.726 --> 02:19:27.388
The invites are printed.
This isnt the time to overreact!


02:19:28.363 --> 02:19:29.330
Kabir.


02:19:30.865 --> 02:19:32.526
We know Natasha is a great girl.


02:19:32.800 --> 02:19:34.768
And we know you like her.


02:19:35.303 --> 02:19:36.793
And of course,
you don't want to hurt her.


02:19:37.839 --> 02:19:40.808
But ask yourself...
Do you really want to marry her?


02:19:41.542 --> 02:19:43.203
And if not, be honest.


02:19:43.277 --> 02:19:44.767
To yourself and to her.


02:19:45.480 --> 02:19:48.381
Of course, shell be hurt.
But in the long run its best for both of you.


02:19:48.549 --> 02:19:50.176
He is absolutely right, Kabir.


02:19:50.451 --> 02:19:52.248
But Ive made a commitment.


02:19:52.620 --> 02:19:54.355
Okay, you screwed up.


02:19:54.355 --> 02:19:56.380
No ones going to send you to prison.


02:19:56.457 --> 02:19:59.017
Its not that simple.
Our parents are involved.


02:19:59.227 --> 02:20:00.057
Parents?


02:20:00.495 --> 02:20:01.621
Dude, its your life.


02:20:04.699 --> 02:20:06.030
You wont get it.


02:20:07.201 --> 02:20:08.031
Just...


02:20:08.703 --> 02:20:10.864
Just let it be, okay? Im sorry.


02:20:11.706 --> 02:20:12.832
Kabir...


02:20:16.611 --> 02:20:17.578
What a guy!


02:20:35.830 --> 02:20:36.854
Laila?


02:20:40.802 --> 02:20:41.826
Why're you shouting?


02:20:42.904 --> 02:20:44.531
Why are you so far?


02:20:58.820 --> 02:20:59.718
Better?


02:21:01.055 --> 02:21:01.885
Best.


02:21:04.959 --> 02:21:05.687
Ammi?


02:21:06.828 --> 02:21:08.295
How are you?


02:21:11.199 --> 02:21:13.167
I met Salman.


02:21:19.540 --> 02:21:22.566
I now know why you and Abu
kept this from me.


02:21:26.180 --> 02:21:27.238
Im sorry, Ammi.


02:21:30.184 --> 02:21:31.242
I love you.


02:21:33.020 --> 02:21:34.544
I love you too, my boy.


02:22:10.858 --> 02:22:14.316
<i>It took a while but.</i>


02:22:19.233 --> 02:22:23.636
<i>I've now learnt to live.</i>


02:22:28.109 --> 02:22:31.806
<i>Without the consolation of tears.</i>


02:22:36.484 --> 02:22:41.148
<i>I've now learnt to live.</i>


02:23:01.042 --> 02:23:07.715
<i>There is someone who brought to mind.</i>


02:23:07.715 --> 02:23:12.277
<i>How I had gotten left behind.</i>


02:23:14.021 --> 02:23:19.687
<i>Life is like a caravan.</i>


02:23:20.828 --> 02:23:24.787
<i>Why are you lonely, my man.</i>


02:23:27.201 --> 02:23:31.661
<i>Just know that we are all here.</i>


02:23:54.862 --> 02:23:57.922
The first rocket indicates that
the pen gates have been opened.


02:23:58.332 --> 02:24:00.800
Second rocket indicates that
the bulls are coming towards us.


02:24:01.135 --> 02:24:02.837
We run at the second rocket.


02:24:02.837 --> 02:24:03.701
Second rocket.


02:24:05.339 --> 02:24:06.897
Oh San Fermin, please protect us.


02:24:08.843 --> 02:24:10.174
If I die...


02:24:10.544 --> 02:24:12.273
my spirit will come back to haunt you.


02:24:12.713 --> 02:24:14.237
Why are you thinking about death?


02:24:14.315 --> 02:24:16.283
Think about what youll do
if you survive.


02:24:20.855 --> 02:24:21.855
Listen...


02:24:22.023 --> 02:24:22.921
a new pact.


02:24:23.791 --> 02:24:25.486
An if-I-get out-alive pact.


02:24:26.661 --> 02:24:29.221
If I get out alive,
III let you read my poetry.


02:24:30.398 --> 02:24:31.899
Why just you? III just...


02:24:31.899 --> 02:24:33.093
get it published.


02:24:33.968 --> 02:24:34.935
You write poetry?


02:24:35.169 --> 02:24:35.999
Yes.


02:24:37.805 --> 02:24:38.772
Okay.


02:24:39.073 --> 02:24:40.904
If I get out alive...


02:24:43.978 --> 02:24:44.672
Okay!


02:24:45.146 --> 02:24:46.980
If I get out alive...


02:24:46.981 --> 02:24:49.016
III go to Morocco with Laila.


02:24:49.016 --> 02:24:49.846
Yeah!


02:24:50.184 --> 02:24:51.208
Thats what III do.


02:24:51.619 --> 02:24:53.786
Whats the worst that could happen?
III get fired.


02:24:53.787 --> 02:24:54.789
- Right?
- Yeah.


02:24:54.790 --> 02:24:55.990
Who cares man?


02:24:55.990 --> 02:24:57.184
III be with her and I will live.


02:24:57.558 --> 02:24:58.718
Well done, my bro!


02:24:59.727 --> 02:25:00.557
Come on, Kabir.


02:25:02.963 --> 02:25:03.631
Okay.


02:25:03.632 --> 02:25:05.326
If I get out alive...


02:25:09.470 --> 02:25:11.028
Shit guys! The gates are open!


02:25:11.372 --> 02:25:12.430
Kabir just say it.


02:25:12.506 --> 02:25:14.201
Its okay, just say it.


02:25:21.482 --> 02:25:24.318
If I get out alive,
III go to London...


02:25:24.318 --> 02:25:26.047
and tell Natasha that...


02:25:35.863 --> 02:25:37.262
Say what? Just say it!


02:25:37.531 --> 02:25:38.759
Come on, Kabir!


02:25:42.737 --> 02:25:44.637
- Come on, Kabir!
- Come on!


02:25:44.705 --> 02:25:47.299
<i>I'm sorry but I can't marry you.</i>


02:25:49.510 --> 02:25:50.175
- Congratulations!
- Look out!


02:25:50.176 --> 02:25:51.405
- Congratulations!
- Look out!


02:28:33.974 --> 02:28:36.677
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your restlessness in your heart.


02:28:36.677 --> 02:28:38.736
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:38.812 --> 02:28:41.372
<i>If you're carrying</i>
the lightning of dreams in your eyes.


02:28:41.448 --> 02:28:42.642
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:28:43.951 --> 02:28:46.943
<i>Like a gust of wind</i>,
learn to live free.


02:28:47.621 --> 02:28:50.590
<i>Learn to flow like</i>
the waves that make a sea.


02:28:51.225 --> 02:28:54.353
<i>Let your arms be wide open</i>,
to every moment you meet.


02:28:55.062 --> 02:28:58.554
<i>May every moment gift you</i>
a new sight to greet.


02:28:59.166 --> 02:29:01.566
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your wonder in your eyes.


02:29:01.635 --> 02:29:03.500
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:29:04.204 --> 02:29:07.298
<i>If you're carrying</i>
your restlessness in your heart.


02:29:08.309 --> 02:29:09.435
<i>You are alive.</i>


02:29:19.853 --> 02:29:19.887
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:19.888 --> 02:29:23.724
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:23.724 --> 02:29:27.455
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:27.528 --> 02:29:31.430
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:31.498 --> 02:29:35.161
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:35.302 --> 02:29:39.139
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:29:39.139 --> 02:29:42.506
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:29:51.318 --> 02:29:55.687
<i>Just when the heart</i>
started moving to another beat.


02:29:58.993 --> 02:30:03.453
<i>Out of nowhere</i>
a new thought found its feet.


02:30:06.533 --> 02:30:10.370
<i>That life gives you just one shot.</i>


02:30:10.371 --> 02:30:14.041
<i>So why not love it with all you've got.</i>


02:30:14.041 --> 02:30:17.909
<i>Who knows what we're waiting for</i>


02:30:17.978 --> 02:30:22.210
<i>'Cause life is here and life is now.</i>


02:30:25.886 --> 02:30:30.914
<i>What was only a desire till yesterday.</i>


02:30:33.660 --> 02:30:37.960
<i>Is exactly what we've found today.</i>


02:30:41.035 --> 02:30:44.027
<i>Hand in hand let's always be.</i>


02:30:44.872 --> 02:30:48.000
<i>As we wander through our destiny.</i>


02:30:48.609 --> 02:30:52.279
<i>And all day and all night.</i>


02:30:52.279 --> 02:30:57.307
<i>Happiness rains down on</i>
everything in sight.


02:30:59.520 --> 02:31:03.557
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:31:03.557 --> 02:31:07.288
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:31:07.361 --> 02:31:11.198
<i>In the arms of the sun now life will be.</i>


02:31:11.198 --> 02:31:15.362
<i>With the rays in our breath</i>
And a shine when we speak.


02:31:31.285 --> 02:31:34.118
<i>If it can knit a new dream everyday.</i>


02:31:35.122 --> 02:31:37.989
<i>Then you can call it a life.</i>


02:31:38.892 --> 02:31:41.725
<i>If it can lead you down a brand new way.</i>


02:31:42.796 --> 02:31:45.594
<i>Then you can call it a life.</i>


02:31:46.333 --> 02:31:49.234
<i>If it can flirt and fly</i>,
If it can spin and jive.


02:31:49.303 --> 02:31:56.770
<i>Then you can call it a life</i>

